  <p>The following are <a data-x-lt="select element inner content elements" id=select-element-inner-content-elements:select-element-inner-content-elements-2 href=#select-element-inner-content-elements-2><code data-x-lt=select>select</code> element inner content elements</a>:</p>

  <ul class="brief category-list"><li><code data-x-lt=option id=select-element-inner-content-elements:the-option-element><a href=#the-option-element>option</a></code><li><code data-x-lt=optgroup id=select-element-inner-content-elements:the-optgroup-element><a href=#the-optgroup-element>optgroup</a></code><li><code data-x-lt=hr id=select-element-inner-content-elements:the-hr-element><a href=#the-hr-element>hr</a></code><li><a data-x-lt="script-supporting elements" id=select-element-inner-content-elements:script-supporting-elements-2 href=#script-supporting-elements-2>script-supporting elements</a><li><code data-x-lt=noscript id=select-element-inner-content-elements:the-noscript-element><a href=#the-noscript-element>noscript</a></code><li><code data-x-lt=div id=select-element-inner-content-elements:the-div-element><a href=#the-div-element>div</a></code></ul>

  <h6 id=optgroup-element-inner-content-elements><span class=secno>2026</span> <code data-x-lt=optgroup id=optgroup-element-inner-content-elements:the-optgroup-element><a href=#the-optgroup-element>optgroup</a></code> element inner content elements<a class=self-link href=#optgroup-element-inner-content-elements></a></h6>

  <p><dfn data-x="optgroup element inner content elements" id=optgroup-element-inner-content-elements-2><code>optgroup</code> element inner content elements</dfn> are the elements which are
