  <dl class=element><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-categories id=the-hgroup-element:concept-element-categories href=#concept-element-categories>Categories</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="flow content" id=the-hgroup-element:flow-content-2 href=#flow-content-2>Flow content</a>.<dd><a data-x-lt="heading content" id=the-hgroup-element:heading-content-2 href=#heading-content-2>Heading content</a>.<dd><a data-x-lt="palpable content" id=the-hgroup-element:palpable-content-2 href=#palpable-content-2>Palpable content</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-contexts id=the-hgroup-element:concept-element-contexts href=#concept-element-contexts>Contexts in which this element can be used</a>:<dd>Where <a data-x-lt="heading content" id=the-hgroup-element:heading-content-2-2 href=#heading-content-2>heading content</a> is expected.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-content-model id=the-hgroup-element:concept-element-content-model href=#concept-element-content-model>Content model</a>:<dd>Zero or more <code data-x-lt=p id=the-hgroup-element:the-p-element><a href=#the-p-element>p</a></code> elements, followed by one <code data-x-lt=h1 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h1</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=h2 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements-2><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h2</a></code>,
   <code data-x-lt=h3 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements-3><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h3</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=h4 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements-4><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h4</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=h5 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements-5><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h5</a></code>, or <code data-x-lt=h6 id=the-hgroup-element:the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements-6><a href=#the-h1,-h2,-h3,-h4,-h5,-and-h6-elements>h6</a></code> element, followed by zero
