  <h4 id=the-ol-element><span class=secno>2026</span> The <dfn data-dfn-type=element data-x=ol><code>ol</code></dfn> element<a class=self-link href=#the-ol-element></a></h4><div class="mdn-anno wrapped"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/ol title="The <ol> HTML element represents an ordered list of items — typically rendered as a numbered list.">Element/ol</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>4+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>1+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera unknown"><span>Opera</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>Yes</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios unknown"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android unknown"><span>Opera Android</span><span>?</span></span></div></div></div>

