  <p>The <code data-x-lt=dt id=the-dt-element:the-dt-element-3><a href=#the-dt-element>dt</a></code> element <a data-x-lt=represents id=the-dt-element:represents href=#represents>represents</a> the term, or name, part of a
  term-description group in a description list (<code data-x-lt=dl id=the-dt-element:the-dl-element-3><a href=#the-dl-element>dl</a></code> element).</p>

  <p class=note>The <code data-x-lt=dt id=the-dt-element:the-dt-element-4><a href=#the-dt-element>dt</a></code> element itself, when used in a <code data-x-lt=dl id=the-dt-element:the-dl-element-4><a href=#the-dl-element>dl</a></code> element, does
