   <p>In the following example, multiple <code data-x-lt=main id=the-main-element:the-main-element-5><a href=#the-main-element>main</a></code> elements are used and script is used to
   make navigation work without a server roundtrip and to set the <code data-x-lt=attr-hidden id=the-main-element:attr-hidden-2><a href=#attr-hidden>hidden</a></code> attribute on those that are not current:

