nt-model href=#concept-element-content-model>Content model</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt=transparent id=the-a-element:transparent href=#transparent>Transparent</a>, but there must be no <a data-x-lt="interactive content" id=the-a-element:interactive-content-2-2 href=#interactive-content-2>interactive content</a> descendant,
