  <p>An element implementing the <code data-x-lt=hyperlinkelementutils id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlinkelementutils><a href=#hyperlinkelementutils>HyperlinkElementUtils</a></code> mixin is a <dfn data-x="hyperlink element" id=hyperlink-element>hyperlink
  element</dfn>.</p>

  <p>A <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink element</a> has an associated <dfn data-x=concept-hyperlink-url id=concept-hyperlink-url>url</dfn> (null or a <a data-x-lt=url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:url href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url data-x-internal=url>URL</a>). It is initially null.

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>A <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-2 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink element</a> has the following <a data-x-lt="extract an origin" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:extract-an-origin href=#extract-an-origin>extract an origin</a> steps:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> is null, then
   return null.<li><p>Return <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-2 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a>'s
   <a data-x-lt=concept-url-origin id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-origin href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-origin data-x-internal=concept-url-origin>origin</a>.</ol>
  </div>

  <p>A <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-3 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink element</a> must have an associated <dfn data-x=concept-hyperlink-url-set id=concept-hyperlink-url-set>set the url</dfn> algorithm.</p>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>When <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-4 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink elements</a> are created, the user agent
  must <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url-set id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-set href=#concept-hyperlink-url-set>set the url</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>A <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-5 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink element</a> has an associated
  <dfn id=reinitialise-url data-x="reinitialize url">reinitialize url</dfn> algorithm, which runs these
  steps:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If the element's <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-3 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> is non-null, its <a data-x-lt=concept-url-scheme id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-scheme href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme data-x-internal=concept-url-scheme>scheme</a> is "<code>blob</code>", and it has an
   <a data-x-lt="opaque path" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:opaque-path href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#url-opaque-path data-x-internal=opaque-path>opaque path</a>, then terminate these steps.<li><p><a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url-set id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-set-2 href=#concept-hyperlink-url-set>Set the url</a>.</ol>
  </div>

  <p>A <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-6 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink element</a> must have an associated <dfn data-x="update href" id=update-href>update <code>href</code></dfn>
  algorithm.</p>

  

  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=a,area data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-hyperlink-hreflang id=attr-hyperlink-hreflang><code>hreflang</code></dfn>
  attribute on <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-7 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink elements</a> that create <a data-x-lt=hyperlink id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink href=#hyperlink>hyperlinks</a>, if present, gives the language of the linked resource. It is
  purely advisory. The value must be a valid BCP 47 language tag. <a href=#refsBCP47>[BCP47]</a> User agents must not consider this attribute authoritative — upon fetching the
  resource, user agents must use only language information associated with the resource to determine
  its language, not metadata included in the link to the resource.</p>

  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=a,area data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-hyperlink-type id=attr-hyperlink-type><code>type</code></dfn>
  attribute on <a data-x-lt="hyperlink element" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:hyperlink-element-8 href=#hyperlink-element>hyperlink elements</a>, if present, gives the
  <a data-x-lt="mime type" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:mime-type href=https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type data-x-internal=mime-type>MIME type</a> of the linked resource. It is purely advisory. The value must be a
  <a data-x-lt="valid mime type string" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:valid-mime-type-string href=https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-mime-type data-x-internal=valid-mime-type-string>valid MIME type string</a>. User agents must not consider the <code data-x-lt=attr-hyperlink-type id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:attr-hyperlink-type><a href=#attr-hyperlink-type>type</a></code> attribute authoritative — upon fetching the
  resource, user agents must not use metadata included in the link to the resource to determine its
  type.</p>

  

  <hr>

