  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt="reinitialize url" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:reinitialise-url href=#reinitialise-url>Reinitialize url</a>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-3 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-4 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> is null, return the
   empty string.<li><p>Return the <a data-x-lt="serialization of an origin" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:ascii-serialisation-of-an-origin href=#ascii-serialisation-of-an-origin>serialization</a> of
   <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-4 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-5 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-origin id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-origin-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-origin data-x-internal=concept-url-origin>origin</a>.</ol>
