  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HyperlinkElementUtils data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-hyperlink-protocol id=dom-hyperlink-protocol><code>protocol</code></dfn> getter steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt="reinitialize url" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:reinitialise-url-2 href=#reinitialise-url>Reinitialize url</a>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-5 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-6 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> is null, return
   "<code>:</code>".<li><p>Return <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-6 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-7 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-scheme id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-scheme-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme data-x-internal=concept-url-scheme>scheme</a>, followed by "<code>:</code>".</ol>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <code data-x-lt=dom-hyperlink-protocol id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:dom-hyperlink-protocol-2><a href=#dom-hyperlink-protocol>protocol</a></code> setter steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt="reinitialize url" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:reinitialise-url-3 href=#reinitialise-url>Reinitialize url</a>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-7 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-8 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> is null, then
   return.<li>
    <p><a data-x-lt="basic url parser" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-basic-url-parser data-x-internal=basic-url-parser>Basic URL parse</a> the given value, followed by "<code>:</code>", with <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-8 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-9 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a> as
    <a data-x-lt="basic url parser url" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser-url href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-url-parser-url data-x-internal=basic-url-parser-url><i>url</i></a> and <a data-x-lt="scheme start state" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:scheme-start-state href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#scheme-start-state data-x-internal=scheme-start-state>scheme start state</a> as
    <a data-x-lt="basic url parser state override" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser-state-override href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-url-parser-state-override data-x-internal=basic-url-parser-state-override><i>state override</i></a>.</p>

    <p class=note>Because the URL parser ignores multiple consecutive colons, providing a value
    of "<code>https:</code>" (or even "<code>https::::</code>") is the same as
    providing a value of "<code>https</code>".</p>
   <li><p><a data-x-lt="update href" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:update-href href=#update-href>Update <code data-x-lt=href>href</code></a>.</ol>
