   empty string.<li><p>Return <a data-x-lt=this id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:this-10 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-hyperlink-url id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-hyperlink-url-11 href=#concept-hyperlink-url>url</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-username id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-username href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-username data-x-internal=concept-url-username>username</a>.</ol>
