    <ol><li><p>Let <var>input</var> be the given value with a single leading "<code>#</code>"
     removed, if any.<li><p>Set <var>url</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-fragment id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:concept-url-fragment-4 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-fragment data-x-internal=concept-url-fragment>fragment</a> to the empty
     string.<li><p><a data-x-lt="basic url parser" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser-7 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-basic-url-parser data-x-internal=basic-url-parser>Basic URL parse</a> <var>input</var>, with
     <var>url</var> as <a data-x-lt="basic url parser url" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser-url-7 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-url-parser-url data-x-internal=basic-url-parser-url><i>url</i></a> and <a data-x-lt="fragment state" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:fragment-state href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#fragment-state data-x-internal=fragment-state>fragment
     state</a> as <a data-x-lt="basic url parser state override" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:basic-url-parser-state-override-7 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#basic-url-parser-state-override data-x-internal=basic-url-parser-state-override><i>state
     override</i></a>.</ol>
   <li><p><a data-x-lt="update href" id=api-for-hyperlink-elements:update-href-9 href=#update-href>Update <code data-x-lt=href>href</code></a>.</ol>
  </div>


  <h4 id=api-for-a-and-area-elements><span class=secno>2026</span> API for <code data-x-lt=a id=api-for-a-and-area-elements:the-a-element><a href=#the-a-element>a</a></code> and <code data-x-lt=area id=api-for-a-and-area-elements:the-area-element><a href=#the-area-element>area</a></code> elements<a class=self-link href=#api-for-a-and-area-elements></a></h4>

