  <p>In any case, only the first <code data-x-lt=link id=link-type-manifest:the-link-element-5><a href=#the-link-element>link</a></code> element in <a data-x-lt="tree order" id=link-type-manifest:tree-order href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-order data-x-internal=tree-order>tree order</a> whose <code data-x-lt=attr-link-rel id=link-type-manifest:attr-link-rel><a href=#attr-link-rel>rel</a></code> attribute contains the token <code data-x-lt=rel-manifest id=link-type-manifest:link-type-manifest-4><a href=#link-type-manifest>manifest</a></code> may be used.</p>

  <p>A user agent must not <a data-x-lt="delay the load event" id=link-type-manifest:delay-the-load-event href=#delay-the-load-event>delay the load event</a> for this link type.</p>

  <div algorithm="">
