    <p><a data-x-lt="fetch a modulepreload module script graph" id=link-type-modulepreload:fetch-a-modulepreload-module-script-graph href=#fetch-a-modulepreload-module-script-graph>Fetch a modulepreload module script graph</a> given <var>url</var>,
