   browsing-context connected</a>.<li><p>When the <code data-x-lt=attr-link-href id=link-type-preconnect:attr-link-href><a href=#attr-link-href>href</a></code> attribute of the <code data-x-lt=link id=link-type-preconnect:the-link-element-4><a href=#the-link-element>link</a></code>
