   element of an <a data-x-lt="external resource link" id=link-type-prefetch:external-resource-link-4 href=#external-resource-link>external resource link</a> that is already <a data-x-lt="browsing-context connected" id=link-type-prefetch:browsing-context-connected-2 href=#browsing-context-connected>browsing-context
   connected</a> is changed.<li><p>When the <code data-x-lt=attr-link-crossorigin id=link-type-prefetch:attr-link-crossorigin><a href=#attr-link-crossorigin>crossorigin</a></code> attribute of the
   <code data-x-lt=link id=link-type-prefetch:the-link-element-5><a href=#the-link-element>link</a></code> element of an <a data-x-lt="external resource link" id=link-type-prefetch:external-resource-link-5 href=#external-resource-link>external resource
   link</a> that is already <a data-x-lt="browsing-context connected" id=link-type-prefetch:browsing-context-connected-3 href=#browsing-context-connected>browsing-context connected</a> is set, changed, or
