  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <a data-x-lt="fetch and process the linked resource" id=link-type-prefetch:fetch-and-process-the-linked-resource-2 href=#fetch-and-process-the-linked-resource>fetch and process the linked resource</a> algorithm for <code data-x-lt=rel-prefetch id=link-type-prefetch:link-type-prefetch-4><a href=#link-type-prefetch>prefetch</a></code> links, given a <code data-x-lt=link id=link-type-prefetch:the-link-element-6><a href=#the-link-element>link</a></code> element
  <var>el</var>, is as follows:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If <var>el</var>'s <code data-x-lt=attr-link-href id=link-type-prefetch:attr-link-href-2><a href=#attr-link-href>href</a></code> attribute's value is the
   empty string, then return.<li><p>Let <var>options</var> be the result of <a data-x-lt="create link options from element" id=link-type-prefetch:create-link-options-from-element href=#create-link-options-from-element>creating link options</a> from <var>el</var>.<li><p>Let <var>request</var> be the result of <a data-x-lt="create a link request" id=link-type-prefetch:create-a-link-request href=#create-a-link-request>creating a
