     <dl><dt>H.264 Constrained baseline profile video (main and extended video compatible) level 3 and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.42e01e, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>H.264 Extended profile video (baseline-compatible) level 3 and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.58a01e, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="avc1.58A01E, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>H.264 Main profile video level 3 and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.4d401e, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="avc1.4D401E, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>H.264 'High' profile video (incompatible with main, baseline, or extended profiles) level 3 and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;avc1.64001e, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="avc1.64001E, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>MPEG-4 Visual Simple Profile Level 0 video and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;mp4v.20.8, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="mp4v.20.8, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>MPEG-4 Advanced Simple Profile Level 0 video and Low-Complexity AAC audio in MP4 container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs=&quot;mp4v.20.240, mp4a.40.2&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.mp4' type='video/mp4; codecs="mp4v.20.240, mp4a.40.2"'></code></pre><dt>MPEG-4 Visual Simple Profile Level 0 video and AMR audio in 3GPP container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.3gp' type='video/3gpp; codecs=&quot;mp4v.20.8, samr&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.3gp' type='video/3gpp; codecs="mp4v.20.8, samr"'></code></pre><dt>Theora video and Vorbis audio in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs=&quot;theora, vorbis&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs="theora, vorbis"'></code></pre><dt>Theora video and Speex audio in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs=&quot;theora, speex&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs="theora, speex"'></code></pre><dt>Vorbis audio alone in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='audio.ogg' type='audio/ogg; codecs=vorbis'>">&lt;source src='audio.ogg' type='audio/ogg; codecs=vorbis'></code></pre><dt>Speex audio alone in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='audio.spx' type='audio/ogg; codecs=speex'>">&lt;source src='audio.spx' type='audio/ogg; codecs=speex'></code></pre><dt>FLAC audio alone in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='audio.oga' type='audio/ogg; codecs=flac'>">&lt;source src='audio.oga' type='audio/ogg; codecs=flac'></code></pre><dt>Dirac video and Vorbis audio in Ogg container<dd><pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs=&quot;dirac, vorbis&quot;'>">&lt;source src='video.ogv' type='video/ogg; codecs="dirac, vorbis"'></code></pre></dl>
    </div>

    <p>The <code data-x-lt=attr-source-srcset id=the-source-element:attr-source-srcset-4><a href=#attr-source-srcset>srcset</a></code> and <code data-x-lt=attr-source-sizes id=the-source-element:attr-source-sizes-5><a href=#attr-source-sizes>sizes</a></code> attributes must not be present.</p>
   </dl>

  

