  <var>insertedNode</var>, are:</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>parent</var> be <var>insertedNode</var>'s <a data-x-lt=parent id=the-source-element:parent href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-parent data-x-internal=parent>parent</a>.<li><p>If <var>parent</var> is a <a data-x-lt="media element" id=the-source-element:media-element-7 href=#media-element>media element</a> that has no <code data-x-lt=attr-media-src id=the-source-element:attr-media-src-2><a href=#attr-media-src>src</a></code> attribute and whose <code data-x-lt=dom-media-networkstate id=the-source-element:dom-media-networkstate><a href=#dom-media-networkstate>networkState</a></code> has the value <code data-x-lt=dom-media-network_empty id=the-source-element:dom-media-network_empty><a href=#dom-media-network_empty>NETWORK_EMPTY</a></code>, then invoke that <a data-x-lt="media element" id=the-source-element:media-element-8 href=#media-element>media
