   algorithm</a>.<li><p>If <var>parent</var> is a <code data-x-lt=picture id=the-source-element:the-picture-element-9><a href=#the-picture-element>picture</a></code> element, then <a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=the-source-element:list-iterate href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>for each</a> <var>child</var> of <var>parent</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-tree-child id=the-source-element:concept-tree-child href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-child data-x-internal=concept-tree-child>children</a>, if <var>child</var> is an <code data-x-lt=img id=the-source-element:the-img-element-8><a href=#the-img-element>img</a></code> element,
   then count this as a <a data-x-lt="relevant mutations" id=the-source-element:relevant-mutations href=#relevant-mutations>relevant mutation</a> for
   <var>child</var>.</ol>
