  <var>removedNode</var>, <var>isSubtreeRoot</var>, and <var>oldAncestor</var> are:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If <var>isSubtreeRoot</var> is true and <var>oldAncestor</var> is a <code data-x-lt=picture id=the-source-element:the-picture-element-11><a href=#the-picture-element>picture</a></code>
