   <pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<p>according to a study covering several billion pages, about 62% of documents on the web in 2007 triggered the quirks rendering mode of web browsers, about 30% triggered the almost standards mode, and about 9% triggered the standards mode.</p> <p><img src=&quot;rendering-mode-pie-chart.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot;></p>">&lt;p>According to a study covering several billion pages,
