  <a data-x-lt=reflect id=the-iframe-element:reflect href=#reflect>reflect</a> the <code data-x-lt=attr-iframe-referrerpolicy id=the-iframe-element:attr-iframe-referrerpolicy-3><a href=#attr-iframe-referrerpolicy>referrerpolicy</a></code> content
  attribute, <a data-x-lt="limited to only known values" id=the-iframe-element:limited-to-only-known-values href=#limited-to-only-known-values>limited to only known values</a>.</p>
