ement-accessibility-considerations id=the-video-element:concept-element-accessibility-considerations href=#concept-element-accessibility-considerations>Accessibility considerations</a>:<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/#el-video>For authors</a>.<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/#el-video>For implementers</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-sanitization id=the-video-element:concept-element-sanitization href=#concept-element-sanitization>Sanitization</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt=sanitizer-uncategorized id=the-video-element:sanitizer-uncategorized href=#sanitizer-uncategorized>Uncategorized</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-dom id=the-video-element:concept-element-dom href=#concept-element-dom>DOM interface</a>:<dd>
