  <p>The <code data-x-lt=track id=the-track-element:the-track-element><a href=#the-track-element>track</a></code> element allows authors to specify explicit external timed <a data-x-lt="text track" id=the-track-element:text-track href=#text-track>text tracks</a> for <a data-x-lt="media element" id=the-track-element:media-element-2 href=#media-element>media elements</a>. It
  does not <a data-x-lt=represents id=the-track-element:represents href=#represents>represent</a> anything on its own.</p>

