  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLMediaElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-media-audiotracks id=dom-media-audiotracks><code>audioTracks</code></dfn> attribute of a <a data-x-lt="media element" id=media-resources-with-multiple-media-tracks:media-element href=#media-element>media element</a>
