  the list represented by the <code data-x-lt=texttracklist id=text-track-api:texttracklist-6><a href=#texttracklist>TextTrackList</a></code> object minus one, if any. If there are no
  <a data-x-lt="text track" id=text-track-api:text-track-8 href=#text-track>text tracks</a> in the list, there are no <a data-x-lt="supported property indices" id=text-track-api:supported-property-indices-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-supported-property-indices data-x-internal=supported-property-indices>supported property
  indices</a>.</p>
