  <code data-x-lt=texttracklist id=text-track-api:texttracklist-7><a href=#texttracklist>TextTrackList</a></code> object for a given index <var>index</var>, the user agent must return
  the <var>index</var>th <a data-x-lt="text track" id=text-track-api:text-track-9 href=#text-track>text track</a> in the list represented by the
  <code data-x-lt=texttracklist id=text-track-api:texttracklist-8><a href=#texttracklist>TextTrackList</a></code> object.</p>
  </div>

