  return the first <code data-x-lt=texttrack id=text-track-api:texttrack-6><a href=#texttrack>TextTrack</a></code> in the <code data-x-lt=texttracklist id=text-track-api:texttracklist-9><a href=#texttracklist>TextTrackList</a></code> object whose <code data-x-lt=dom-texttrack-id id=text-track-api:dom-texttrack-id><a href=#dom-texttrack-id>id</a></code> IDL attribute would return a value equal to the value of the
  <var>id</var> argument. When no tracks match the given argument, the method must return null.</p>
