  <a data-x-lt="text track cue pause-on-exit flag" id=text-track-api:text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag-3 href=#text-track-cue-pause-on-exit-flag>text track cue pause-on-exit flag</a> must be set if the new value is true, and must be
  unset otherwise.</p>
