  <p>The <code data-x-lt=map id=the-map-element:the-map-element><a href=#the-map-element>map</a></code> element, in conjunction with an <code data-x-lt=img id=the-map-element:the-img-element><a href=#the-img-element>img</a></code> element and any
  <code data-x-lt=area id=the-map-element:the-area-element><a href=#the-area-element>area</a></code> element descendants, defines an <a data-x-lt="image map" id=the-map-element:image-map href=#image-map>image map</a>. The element
  <a data-x-lt=represents id=the-map-element:represents href=#represents>represents</a> its children.</p>

  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=map data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-map-name id=attr-map-name><code>name</code></dfn> attribute gives
  the map a name so that it can be <a data-x-lt=referenced id=the-map-element:referenced href=#referenced>referenced</a>. The attribute must be present and must
  have a non-empty value with no <a data-x-lt="ascii whitespace" id=the-map-element:space-characters href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace data-x-internal=space-characters>ASCII whitespace</a>. The value of the <code data-x-lt=attr-map-name id=the-map-element:attr-map-name-2><a href=#attr-map-name>name</a></code> attribute must not be equal to the value of the <code data-x-lt=attr-map-name id=the-map-element:attr-map-name-3><a href=#attr-map-name>name</a></code> attribute of another <code data-x-lt=map id=the-map-element:the-map-element-2><a href=#the-map-element>map</a></code> element in the same
  <a data-x-lt=tree id=the-map-element:tree href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree data-x-internal=tree>tree</a>. If the <code data-x-lt=attr-id id=the-map-element:the-id-attribute><a href=#the-id-attribute>id</a></code> attribute is also specified, both
  attributes must have the same value.</p>

  <dl class=domintro><dt><code><var>map</var>.<a id=dom-map-areas-dev href=#dom-map-areas>areas</a></code><dd>
    <p>Returns an <code data-x-lt=htmlcollection id=the-map-element:htmlcollection-2><a href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-htmlcollection data-x-internal=htmlcollection>HTMLCollection</a></code> of the <code data-x-lt=area id=the-map-element:the-area-element-2><a href=#the-area-element>area</a></code> elements in the
    <code data-x-lt=map id=the-map-element:the-map-element-3><a href=#the-map-element>map</a></code>.</p>
   </dl>

  

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLMapElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-map-areas id=dom-map-areas><code>areas</code></dfn>
  attribute must return an <code data-x-lt=htmlcollection id=the-map-element:htmlcollection-3><a href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-htmlcollection data-x-internal=htmlcollection>HTMLCollection</a></code> rooted at the <code data-x-lt=map id=the-map-element:the-map-element-4><a href=#the-map-element>map</a></code> element, whose
