    <p>Creates a <code data-x-lt=tr id=the-table-element:the-tr-element-3><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code> element, along with a <code data-x-lt=tbody id=the-table-element:the-tbody-element-4><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code> if required, inserts them
