   <pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<table> <caption>characteristics with positive and negative sides</caption> <thead> <tr> <th> characteristic <th> negative <th> positive <tbody> <tr> <th> mood <td> sad <td> happy <tr> <th> grade <td> failing <td> passing </table>">&lt;table>
