nt-contexts href=#concept-element-contexts>Contexts in which this element can be used</a>:<dd>As the first element child of a <code data-x-lt=table id=the-caption-element:the-table-element><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code> element.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-content-model id=the-caption-element:concept-element-content-model href=#concept-element-content-model>Content model</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="flow content" id=the-caption-element:flow-content-2 href=#flow-content-2>Flow content</a>, but with no descendant <code data-x-lt=table id=the-caption-element:the-table-element-2><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code> elements.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-attributes id=the-caption-element:concept-element-attributes href=#concept-element-attributes>Content attributes</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="global attributes" id=the-caption-element:global-attributes href=#global-attributes>Global attributes</a><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-accessibility-considerations id=the-caption-element:concept-element-accessibility-considerations href=#concept-element-accessibility-considerations>Accessibility considerations</a>:<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/#el-caption>For authors</a>.<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/#el-caption>For implementers</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-sanitization id=the-caption-element:concept-element-sanitization href=#concept-element-sanitization>Sanitization</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt=sanitizer-category-default id=the-caption-element:sanitizer-category-default href=#sanitizer-category-default>Default</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-dom id=the-caption-element:concept-element-dom href=#concept-element-dom>DOM interface</a>:<dd>
