  parent and that is a <code data-x-lt=table id=the-colgroup-element:the-table-element-3><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code> element.</p>

  <p>If the <code data-x-lt=colgroup id=the-colgroup-element:the-colgroup-element-2><a href=#the-colgroup-element>colgroup</a></code> element contains no <code data-x-lt=col id=the-colgroup-element:the-col-element-2><a href=#the-col-element>col</a></code> elements, then the element
  may have a <dfn data-dfn-for=colgroup data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-colgroup-span id=attr-colgroup-span><code>span</code></dfn>
  content attribute specified, whose value must be a <a data-x-lt="valid non-negative integer" id=the-colgroup-element:valid-non-negative-integer href=#valid-non-negative-integer>valid non-negative integer</a> greater
