  <p>If a <code data-x-lt=col id=the-col-element:the-col-element><a href=#the-col-element>col</a></code> element has a parent and that is a <code data-x-lt=colgroup id=the-col-element:the-colgroup-element-3><a href=#the-colgroup-element>colgroup</a></code> element that
  itself has a parent that is a <code data-x-lt=table id=the-col-element:the-table-element><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code> element, then the <code data-x-lt=col id=the-col-element:the-col-element-2><a href=#the-col-element>col</a></code> element
  <a data-x-lt=represents id=the-col-element:represents href=#represents>represents</a> one or more <a data-x-lt=concept-column id=the-col-element:concept-column href=#concept-column>columns</a> in the <a data-x-lt=concept-column-group id=the-col-element:concept-column-group href=#concept-column-group>column group</a> represented by that <code data-x-lt=colgroup id=the-col-element:the-colgroup-element-4><a href=#the-colgroup-element>colgroup</a></code>.</p>

  <p>The element may have a <dfn data-dfn-for=col data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-col-span id=attr-col-span><code>span</code></dfn> content attribute specified, whose value must be a
  <a data-x-lt="valid non-negative integer" id=the-col-element:valid-non-negative-integer href=#valid-non-negative-integer>valid non-negative integer</a> greater than zero and less than or equal to 1000.</p>

  

  <p>The <code data-x-lt=col id=the-col-element:the-col-element-3><a href=#the-col-element>col</a></code> element and its <code data-x-lt=attr-col-span id=the-col-element:attr-col-span-4><a href=#attr-col-span>span</a></code> attribute take
  part in the <a data-x-lt="table model" id=the-col-element:table-model href=#table-model>table model</a>.</p>

  


