  <dl class=element><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-categories id=the-thead-element:concept-element-categories href=#concept-element-categories>Categories</a>:<dd>None.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-contexts id=the-thead-element:concept-element-contexts href=#concept-element-contexts>Contexts in which this element can be used</a>:<dd>As a child of a <code data-x-lt=table id=the-thead-element:the-table-element><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code> element, after any
