<dd>None.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-contexts id=the-td-element:concept-element-contexts href=#concept-element-contexts>Contexts in which this element can be used</a>:<dd>As a child of a <code data-x-lt=tr id=the-td-element:the-tr-element><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code> element.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-content-model id=the-td-element:concept-element-content-model href=#concept-element-content-model>Content model</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="flow content" id=the-td-element:flow-content-2 href=#flow-content-2>Flow content</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-attributes id=the-td-element:concept-element-attributes href=#concept-element-attributes>Content attributes</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="global attributes" id=the-td-element:global-attributes href=#global-attributes>Global attributes</a><dd><code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-colspan id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-colspan><a href=#attr-tdth-colspan>colspan</a></code><dd><code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-rowspan id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-rowspan><a href=#attr-tdth-rowspan>rowspan</a></code><dd><code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-headers id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-headers><a href=#attr-tdth-headers>headers</a></code><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-accessibility-considerations id=the-td-element:concept-element-accessibility-considerations href=#concept-element-accessibility-considerations>Accessibility considerations</a>:<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/#el-td>For authors</a>.<dd><a href=https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/#el-td>For implementers</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-sanitization id=the-td-element:concept-element-sanitization href=#concept-element-sanitization>Sanitization</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt=sanitizer-category-default id=the-td-element:sanitizer-category-default href=#sanitizer-category-default>Default</a> with attributes <code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-colspan id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-colspan-2><a href=#attr-tdth-colspan>colspan</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-headers id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-headers-2><a href=#attr-tdth-headers>headers</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=attr-tdth-rowspan id=the-td-element:attr-tdth-rowspan-2><a href=#attr-tdth-rowspan>rowspan</a></code>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-dom id=the-td-element:concept-element-dom href=#concept-element-dom>DOM interface</a>:<dd>
