&lt;/form></code></pre>

  <p>We can use an <code data-x-lt=input id="writing-a-form's-user-interface:the-input-element-6"><a href=#the-input-element>input</a></code> element with its <code data-x-lt=attr-input-type id="writing-a-form's-user-interface:attr-input-type-5"><a href=#attr-input-type>type</a></code>
  attribute set to <code data-x-lt=attr-input-type-time id="writing-a-form's-user-interface:time-state-(type=time)"><a href="#time-state-(type=time)">time</a></code> to ask for a delivery time. Many
