  <code data-x-lt=date>Date</code> object</a>, given a string <var>input</var>, is as follows</strong>: If <a data-x-lt="parse a week string" id="week-state-(type=week):parse-a-week-string-3" href=#parse-a-week-string>parsing a week</a> from <var>input</var> results in an error, then
