   <p>The <code data-x-lt=dom-input-value id="time-state-(type=time):dom-input-value-2"><a href=#dom-input-value>value</a></code> IDL attribute is in mode <a data-x-lt=dom-input-value-value id="time-state-(type=time):dom-input-value-value" href=#dom-input-value-value>value</a>.</p>

   <p>The <code data-x-lt=event-input id="time-state-(type=time):event-input"><a href=https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#event-type-input data-x-internal=event-input>input</a></code> and <code data-x-lt=event-change id="time-state-(type=time):event-change"><a href=#event-change>change</a></code> events <a data-x-lt=concept-input-apply id="time-state-(type=time):concept-input-apply-2" href=#concept-input-apply>apply</a>.</p>

