  <div class=bookkeeping>

   <p>The following common <code data-x-lt=input id="file-upload-state-(type=file):the-input-element-5"><a href=#the-input-element>input</a></code> element content attributes and IDL attributes <a data-x-lt=concept-input-apply id="file-upload-state-(type=file):concept-input-apply" href=#concept-input-apply>apply</a> to the element:
