   <code data-x-lt=dom-textarea/input-select id="file-upload-state-(type=file):dom-textarea/input-select"><a href=#dom-textarea/input-select>select()</a></code> method.</p>

   <p>The <code data-x-lt=dom-input-value id="file-upload-state-(type=file):dom-input-value-4"><a href=#dom-input-value>value</a></code> IDL attribute is in mode <a data-x-lt=dom-input-value-filename id="file-upload-state-(type=file):dom-input-value-filename" href=#dom-input-value-filename>filename</a>.</p>

   <p>The <code data-x-lt=event-input id="file-upload-state-(type=file):event-input-2"><a href=https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#event-type-input data-x-internal=event-input>input</a></code> and <code data-x-lt=event-change id="file-upload-state-(type=file):event-change-2"><a href=#event-change>change</a></code> events <a data-x-lt=concept-input-apply id="file-upload-state-(type=file):concept-input-apply-2" href=#concept-input-apply>apply</a>.</p>

   <p>The following content attributes must not be specified and <a data-x-lt="do not apply" id="file-upload-state-(type=file):do-not-apply" href=#do-not-apply>do not apply</a> to the
