t=input-minlength" title="Minimum length attribute for input fields">caniuse.com table</a></span></span></div></div></div><p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=input data-dfn-type=element-attr data-x=attr-input-minlength id=attr-input-minlength><code>minlength</code></dfn>
