  attribute</a>.</p>

  <p>If the <code data-x-lt=input id=the-maxlength-and-minlength-attributes:the-input-element><a href=#the-input-element>input</a></code> element has a <a data-x-lt="maximum allowed value length" id=the-maxlength-and-minlength-attributes:maximum-allowed-value-length href=#maximum-allowed-value-length>maximum allowed value length</a>, then the
