   <p>Here, a password is given a minimum length:</p>

   <pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<p><label>username: <input name=u required></label> <p><label>password: <input name=p required minlength=12></label>">&lt;p>&lt;label>Username: &lt;input name=u required>&lt;/label>
&lt;p>&lt;label>Password: &lt;input name=p required minlength=12>&lt;/label></code></pre>

