    <p>If <var>value</var> subtracted from the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min-zero id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-zero-2 href=#concept-input-min-zero>step
    base</a> is not an integral multiple of the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-3 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value
    step</a>, then set <var>value</var> to the nearest value that, when subtracted from
    the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min-zero id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-zero-3 href=#concept-input-min-zero>step base</a>, is an integral multiple of the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-4 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value step</a>, and that is less than <var>value</var> if
    the method invoked was the <code data-x-lt=dom-input-stepdown id=common-input-element-apis:dom-input-stepdown-2><a href=#dom-input-stepdown>stepDown()</a></code> method, and more
    than <var>value</var> otherwise.</p>

    <p>Otherwise (<var>value</var> subtracted from the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min-zero id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-zero-4 href=#concept-input-min-zero>step base</a> is an integral multiple of the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-5 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value step</a>):</p>

    <ol><li><p>Let <var>n</var> be the argument.<li><p>Let <var>delta</var> be the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-6 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value
     step</a> multiplied by <var>n</var>.<li><p>If the method invoked was the <code data-x-lt=dom-input-stepdown id=common-input-element-apis:dom-input-stepdown-3><a href=#dom-input-stepdown>stepDown()</a></code> method,
