   <li><p>If the element has a <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-5 href=#concept-input-min>minimum</a>, and <var>value</var>
   is less than that <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-6 href=#concept-input-min>minimum</a>, then set
   <var>value</var> to the smallest value that, when subtracted from the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min-zero id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-zero-5 href=#concept-input-min-zero>step base</a>, is an integral multiple of the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-7 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value step</a>, and that is more than or equal to
   that <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-7 href=#concept-input-min>minimum</a>.<li><p>If the element has a <a data-x-lt=concept-input-max id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-max-5 href=#concept-input-max>maximum</a>, and <var>value</var>
   is greater than that <a data-x-lt=concept-input-max id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-max-6 href=#concept-input-max>maximum</a>, then
   set <var>value</var> to the largest value that, when subtracted from the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-min-zero id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-min-zero-6 href=#concept-input-min-zero>step base</a>, is an integral multiple of the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-step id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-step-8 href=#concept-input-step>allowed value step</a>, and that is less than or equal to
