     <pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<input type=number value=1 max=0>">&lt;input type=number value=1 max=0></code></pre>
    </div>
   <li><p>Let <var>value as string</var> be the result of running the <a data-x-lt=concept-input-value-number-string id=common-input-element-apis:concept-input-value-number-string-2 href=#concept-input-value-number-string>algorithm to convert a number to a string</a>, as
