    <p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=common-input-element-apis:this-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant settings object" id=common-input-element-apis:relevant-settings-object href=#relevant-settings-object>relevant settings object</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-settings-object-origin id=common-input-element-apis:concept-settings-object-origin href=#concept-settings-object-origin>origin</a> is not <a data-x-lt="same origin" id=common-input-element-apis:same-origin href=#same-origin>same origin</a> with
