    <a data-x-lt="securityerror" id=common-input-element-apis:securityerror-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror data-x-internal=securityerror>"<code data-x-lt=securityerror>SecurityError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=common-input-element-apis:domexception-14><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.</p>

    <p class=note><a data-x-lt=attr-input-type-file id="common-input-element-apis:file-upload-state-(type=file)-3" href="#file-upload-state-(type=file)">File</a> and <a data-x-lt=attr-input-type-color id="common-input-element-apis:color-state-(type=color)-3" href="#color-state-(type=color)">Color</a> inputs are exempted from this check for historical
