   <li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=common-input-element-apis:this-6 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=common-input-element-apis:concept-relevant-global href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a> does not have <a data-x-lt="transient activation" id=common-input-element-apis:transient-activation-2 href=#transient-activation>transient
