   <code data-x-lt=domexception id=common-input-element-apis:domexception-15><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=common-input-element-apis:this-7 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a> is a <code data-x-lt=select id=common-input-element-apis:the-select-element-2><a href=#the-select-element>select</a></code> element, and <a data-x-lt=this id=common-input-element-apis:this-8 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a> is not
