   <code data-x-lt=domexception id=common-input-element-apis:domexception-16><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="show the picker, if applicable" id=common-input-element-apis:show-the-picker,-if-applicable href=#show-the-picker,-if-applicable>Show the picker, if applicable</a>, for <a data-x-lt=this id=common-input-element-apis:this-9 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>.</ol>
