<a data-x-lt="phrasing content" id=the-button-element:phrasing-content-2 href=#phrasing-content-2>Phrasing content</a>.<dd><a data-x-lt="interactive content" id=the-button-element:interactive-content-2 href=#interactive-content-2>Interactive content</a>.<dd><a data-x-lt=category-listed id=the-button-element:category-listed href=#category-listed>Listed</a>, <a data-x-lt=category-label id=the-button-element:category-label href=#category-label>labelable</a>, <a data-x-lt=category-submit id=the-button-element:category-submit href=#category-submit>submittable</a>, and <a data-x-lt=category-autocapitalize-and-autocorrect id=the-button-element:category-autocapitalize href=#category-autocapitalize>autocapitalize-and-autocorrect inheriting</a> <a data-x-lt="form-associated element" id=the-button-element:form-associated-element href=#form-associated-element>form-associated element</a>.<dd><a data-x-lt="palpable content" id=the-button-element:palpable-content-2 href=#palpable-content-2>Palpable content</a>.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-contexts id=the-button-element:concept-element-contexts href=#concept-element-contexts>Contexts in which this element can be used</a>:<dd>Where <a data-x-lt="phrasing content" id=the-button-element:phrasing-content-2-2 href=#phrasing-content-2>phrasing content</a> is expected.<dd>As the first child of a <code data-x-lt=select id=the-button-element:the-select-element><a href=#the-select-element>select</a></code> element.<dt><a data-x-lt=concept-element-content-model id=the-button-element:concept-element-content-model href=#concept-element-content-model>Content model</a>:<dd><a data-x-lt="phrasing content" id=the-button-element:phrasing-content-2-3 href=#phrasing-content-2>Phrasing content</a>, but there must be no <a data-x-lt="interactive content" id=the-button-element:interactive-content-2-2 href=#interactive-content-2>interactive content</a>
   descendant and no descendant with the <code data-x-lt=attr-tabindex id=the-button-element:attr-tabindex><a href=#attr-tabindex>tabindex</a></code> attribute
