  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLFormElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-action id=dom-fs-action><code>action</code></dfn>
  getter steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>attribute</var> be <a data-x-lt=this id=form-submission-attributes:this href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <code data-x-lt=attr-fs-action id=form-submission-attributes:attr-fs-action-3><a href=#attr-fs-action>action</a></code> attribute.<li><p>If <var>attribute</var> is null or <var>attribute</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-attribute-value id=form-submission-attributes:concept-attribute-value href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-attribute-value data-x-internal=concept-attribute-value>value</a> is the empty string, then return
