"" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>3+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>1+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>12.1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>6+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios yes"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>12.1+</span></span></div></div><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLFormElement/encoding title="The HTMLFormElement.encoding property is an alternative name for the enctype element on the DOM HTMLFormElement object.">HTMLFormElement/encoding</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>3+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>1+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>12.1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>5.5+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios yes"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>12.1+</span></span></div></div></div><div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLFormElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-method id=dom-fs-method><code>method</code></dfn> and
  <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLFormElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-enctype id=dom-fs-enctype><code>enctype</code></dfn> IDL
  attributes must <a data-x-lt=reflect id=form-submission-attributes:reflect href=#reflect>reflect</a> the respective content attributes of the same name,
  <a data-x-lt="limited to only known values" id=form-submission-attributes:limited-to-only-known-values href=#limited-to-only-known-values>limited to only known values</a>. The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLFormElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-encoding id=dom-fs-encoding><code>encoding</code></dfn> IDL attribute must <a data-x-lt=reflect id=form-submission-attributes:reflect-2 href=#reflect>reflect</a> the <code data-x-lt=attr-fs-enctype id=form-submission-attributes:attr-fs-enctype-3><a href=#attr-fs-enctype>enctype</a></code> content attribute, <a data-x-lt="limited to only known values" id=form-submission-attributes:limited-to-only-known-values-2 href=#limited-to-only-known-values>limited to only known
  values</a>. The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLButtonElement,HTMLInputElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-formenctype id=dom-fs-formenctype><code>formEnctype</code></dfn> IDL attribute must <a data-x-lt=reflect id=form-submission-attributes:reflect-3 href=#reflect>reflect</a> the
  <code data-x-lt=attr-fs-formenctype id=form-submission-attributes:attr-fs-formenctype-4><a href=#attr-fs-formenctype>formenctype</a></code> content attribute, <a data-x-lt="limited to only known values" id=form-submission-attributes:limited-to-only-known-values-3 href=#limited-to-only-known-values>limited to only
  known values</a>. The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLButtonElement,HTMLInputElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fs-formmethod id=dom-fs-formmethod><code>formMethod</code></dfn> IDL attribute must <a data-x-lt=reflect id=form-submission-attributes:reflect-4 href=#reflect>reflect</a> the
  <code data-x-lt=attr-fs-formmethod id=form-submission-attributes:attr-fs-formmethod-4><a href=#attr-fs-formmethod>formmethod</a></code> content attribute, <a data-x-lt="limited to only known values" id=form-submission-attributes:limited-to-only-known-values-4 href=#limited-to-only-known-values>limited to only known
  values</a>.
