  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLInputElement,HTMLSelectElement,HTMLTextAreaElement data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-fe-autocomplete id=dom-fe-autocomplete><code>autocomplete</code></dfn> IDL attribute, on getting, must return the
  element's <a data-x-lt="idl-exposed autofill value" id=autofill-processing-model:idl-exposed-autofill-value-5 href=#idl-exposed-autofill-value>IDL-exposed autofill value</a>.</p>
