  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=HTMLInputElement,HTMLTextAreaElement data-dfn-type=method data-x=dom-textarea/input-setselectionrange id=dom-textarea/input-setselectionrange><code>setSelectionRange(<var>start</var>, <var>end</var>,
  <var>direction</var>)</code></dfn> method, when invoked, must run the following steps:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If this element is an <code data-x-lt=input id=textFieldSelection:the-input-element-13><a href=#the-input-element>input</a></code> element, and <code data-x-lt=dom-textarea/input-setselectionrange id=textFieldSelection:dom-textarea/input-setselectionrange><a href=#dom-textarea/input-setselectionrange>setSelectionRange()</a></code> <a data-x-lt="do not apply" id=textFieldSelection:do-not-apply-8 href=#do-not-apply>does not apply</a> to this element, throw an
   <a data-x-lt="invalidstateerror" id=textFieldSelection:invalidstateerror-4 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror data-x-internal=invalidstateerror>"<code data-x-lt=invalidstateerror>InvalidStateError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=textFieldSelection:domexception-4><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="set the selection range" id=textFieldSelection:set-the-selection-range-6 href=#set-the-selection-range>Set the selection range</a> with <var>start</var>, <var>end</var>, and
