  <ol><li><p>Set <var>error</var> to the result of <a data-x-lt="normalize newlines" id=the-constraint-validation-api:normalize-newlines href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#normalize-newlines data-x-internal=normalize-newlines>normalizing
