  initialized to. It represents a <code data-x-lt=formdata id=the-formdataevent-interface:formdata-5><a href=https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#formdata data-x-internal=formdata>FormData</a></code> object associated to the <a data-x-lt="entry list" id=the-formdataevent-interface:entry-list href=#entry-list>entry
