  <div class=example>

   <p>The following shows how a <code data-x-lt=details id=the-details-element:the-details-element-26><a href=#the-details-element>details</a></code> element can be used to hide some controls by
   default:</p>

   <pre><code class=html data-x-lt="<details> <summary><label for=fn>name &amp; extension:</label></summary> <p><input type=text id=fn name=fn value=&quot;pillar magazine.pdf&quot;> <p><label><input type=checkbox name=ext checked> hide extension</label> </details>">&lt;details>
