  element <var>dialog</var>:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-dialog-element:assert-2 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>dialog</var>'s <a data-x-lt=dialog-close-watcher id=the-dialog-element:dialog-close-watcher-4 href=#dialog-close-watcher>close
   watcher</a> is null.<li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-dialog-element:assert-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>dialog</var> has an <code data-x-lt=attr-dialog-open id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-open-18><a href=#attr-dialog-open>open</a></code>
