   <li><p>Set <var>element</var>'s <a data-x-lt="dialog toggle task tracker" id=the-dialog-element:dialog-toggle-task-tracker-6 href=#dialog-toggle-task-tracker>dialog toggle task tracker</a> to a struct with <a data-x-lt=toggle-task-task id=the-dialog-element:toggle-task-task-2 href=#toggle-task-task>task</a> set to the just-queued <a data-x-lt=concept-task id=the-dialog-element:concept-task href=#concept-task>task</a> and <a data-x-lt=toggle-task-old-state id=the-dialog-element:toggle-task-old-state-2 href=#toggle-task-old-state>old state</a> set
   to <var>oldState</var>.</ol>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>To retrieve a dialog's <dfn data-x="computed closed-by state" id=computed-closed-by-state>computed closed-by state</dfn>, given a <code data-x-lt=dialog id=the-dialog-element:the-dialog-element-35><a href=#the-dialog-element>dialog</a></code>
  <var>dialog</var>:

  <ol><li>
    <p>If the state of <var>dialog</var>'s <code data-x-lt=attr-dialog-closedby id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-closedby-5><a href=#attr-dialog-closedby>closedby</a></code>
    attribute is <a data-x-lt=attr-dialog-closedby-auto-state id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-closedby-auto-state-2 href=#attr-dialog-closedby-auto-state>Auto</a>:</p>

    <ol><li><p>If <var>dialog</var>'s <a data-x-lt="is modal" id=the-dialog-element:is-modal-8 href=#is-modal>is modal</a> is true, then return <a data-x-lt=attr-dialog-closedby-closerequest-state id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-closedby-closerequest-state-2 href=#attr-dialog-closedby-closerequest-state>Close Request</a>.<li><p>Return <a data-x-lt=attr-dialog-closedby-none-state id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-closedby-none-state-4 href=#attr-dialog-closedby-none-state>None</a>.</ol>
   <li><p>Return the state of <var>dialog</var>'s <code data-x-lt=attr-dialog-closedby id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-closedby-6><a href=#attr-dialog-closedby>closedby</a></code> attribute.</ol>
