   <a data-x-lt="autofocus candidates" id=the-dialog-element:autofocus-candidates href=#autofocus-candidates>autofocus candidates</a>.<li><p>Set <var>topDocument</var>'s <a data-x-lt="autofocus processed flag" id=the-dialog-element:autofocus-processed-flag href=#autofocus-processed-flag>autofocus processed flag</a> to true.</ol>
