  <p>The <dfn data-x="dialog setup steps" id=dialog-setup-steps>dialog setup steps</dfn>, given a <code data-x-lt=dialog id=the-dialog-element:the-dialog-element-38><a href=#the-dialog-element>dialog</a></code> element <var>subject</var>, are
  as follows:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-dialog-element:assert-5 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>subject</var> has an <code data-x-lt=attr-dialog-open id=the-dialog-element:attr-dialog-open-26><a href=#attr-dialog-open>open</a></code>
   attribute.<li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-dialog-element:assert-6 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>subject</var> is <a data-x-lt=connected id=the-dialog-element:connected-6 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#connected data-x-internal=connected>connected</a>.<li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-dialog-element:assert-7 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>subject</var>'s <a data-x-lt="node document" id=the-dialog-element:node-document-14 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document data-x-internal=node-document>node document</a>'s <a data-x-lt="open dialogs list" id=the-dialog-element:open-dialogs-list href=#open-dialogs-list>open dialogs
   list</a> does not <a data-x-lt="list contains" id=the-dialog-element:list-contains-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain data-x-internal=list-contains>contain</a> <var>subject</var>.<li><p>Add <var>subject</var> to <var>subject</var>'s <a data-x-lt="node document" id=the-dialog-element:node-document-15 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document data-x-internal=node-document>node document</a>'s <a data-x-lt="open dialogs list" id=the-dialog-element:open-dialogs-list-2 href=#open-dialogs-list>open
   dialogs list</a>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="set the dialog close watcher" id=the-dialog-element:set-the-dialog-close-watcher href=#set-the-dialog-close-watcher>Set the dialog close watcher</a> with <var>subject</var>.</ol>
  </div>

