    <code data-x-lt=canvas id=the-canvas-element:the-canvas-element-36><a href=#the-canvas-element>canvas</a></code> element as a placeholder. Once the <code data-x-lt=canvas id=the-canvas-element:the-canvas-element-37><a href=#the-canvas-element>canvas</a></code> element has become a
    placeholder for an <code data-x-lt=offscreencanvas id=the-canvas-element:offscreencanvas-5><a href=#offscreencanvas>OffscreenCanvas</a></code> object, its natural size can no longer be
