   <var>settings</var>["<dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasRenderingContext2DSettings data-dfn-type=dict-member data-x=dom-canvasrenderingcontext2dsettings-colorspace id=dom-canvasrenderingcontext2dsettings-colorspace><code>colorSpace</code></dfn>"].<li><p>Set <var>context</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-canvas-color-type id=the-canvas-settings:concept-canvas-color-type-2 href=#concept-canvas-color-type>color type</a> to
   <var>settings</var>["<dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasRenderingContext2DSettings data-dfn-type=dict-member data-x=dom-canvasrenderingcontext2dsettings-colortype id=dom-canvasrenderingcontext2dsettings-colortype><code>colorType</code></dfn>"].<li><p>Set <var>context</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-canvas-will-read-frequently id=the-canvas-settings:concept-canvas-will-read-frequently-3 href=#concept-canvas-will-read-frequently>will read
