   <dt><code><var>segments</var> = <var>context</var>.<a id=dom-context-2d-getlinedash-dev href=#dom-context-2d-getlinedash>getLineDash</a>()</code><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CanvasRenderingContext2D/getLineDash title="The getLineDash() method of the Canvas 2D API's CanvasRenderingContext2D interface gets the current line dash pattern.">CanvasRenderingContext2D/getLineDash</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>27+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>7+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>23+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera unknown"><span>Opera</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>11</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios unknown"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android unknown"><span>Opera Android</span><span>?</span></span></div></div></div><dt><code><var>segments</var> = <var>styles</var>.<a data-x-lt=dom-context-2d-getlinedash id=line-styles:dom-context-2d-getlinedash href=#dom-context-2d-getlinedash>getLineDash</a>()</code><dd>
    <p>Returns a copy of the current line dash pattern. The array returned will always have an even
