  <ol><li><p>Let <var>parsed</var> be the result of <a data-x-lt="parse something according to a css grammar" id=text-styles:parse-something-according-to-a-css-grammar-4 href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css-syntax/#parse-grammar data-x-internal=parse-something-according-to-a-css-grammar>parsing</a> the given value as a CSS <a data-x-lt="<length>" id=text-styles:length-2-6 href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values/#lengths data-x-internal=length-2>&lt;length></a>.<li><p>If <var>parsed</var> is failure, then return.<li><p>Set <a data-x-lt=this id=text-styles:this-6 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-canvastextdrawingstyles-word-spacing id=text-styles:concept-canvastextdrawingstyles-word-spacing-2 href=#concept-canvastextdrawingstyles-word-spacing>word
