  <div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=less-than-two-engines-flag title="Support in one engine only.">⚠</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/CanvasRenderingContext2D/textRendering title="The CanvasRenderingContext2D.textRendering property of the Canvas API provides information to the rendering engine about what to optimize for when rendering text.">CanvasRenderingContext2D/textRendering</a><p class=less-than-two-engines-text>Support in one engine only.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox no"><span>Firefox</span><span>No</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari no"><span>Safari</span><span>No</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>99+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera unknown"><span>Opera</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>99+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge unknown"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie no"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>No</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios unknown"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android unknown"><span>Opera Android</span><span>?</span></span></div></div></div><div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=CanvasTextDrawingStyles data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-context-2d-textrendering id=dom-context-2d-textrendering><code>textRendering</code></dfn> IDL attribute, on
