io/gpuweb/#canvas-context data-x-internal=gpucanvascontext>GPUCanvasContext</a>) <dfn data-dfn-type=typedef data-x=offscreenrenderingcontext id=offscreenrenderingcontext>OffscreenRenderingContext</dfn>;

dictionary <dfn data-dfn-type=dictionary data-x=imageencodeoptions id=imageencodeoptions>ImageEncodeOptions</dfn> {
