  <p>The <code data-x-lt=window id=custom-elements-api:window><a href=#window>Window</a></code> <dfn data-dfn-for=Window data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-window-customelements id=dom-window-customelements><code>customElements</code></dfn> getter steps are:</p>

  <ol><li>
    <p><a data-x-lt=assert id=custom-elements-api:assert href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <a data-x-lt=this id=custom-elements-api:this href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-document-window id=custom-elements-api:concept-document-window href=#concept-document-window>associated
    <code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a>'s <a data-x-lt=document-custom-element-registry id=custom-elements-api:document-custom-element-registry href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-custom-element-registry data-x-internal=document-custom-element-registry>custom element
    registry</a> is a <code data-x-lt=customelementregistry id=custom-elements-api:customelementregistry-3><a href=#customelementregistry>CustomElementRegistry</a></code> object.</p>

    <p class=note>A <code data-x-lt=window id=custom-elements-api:window-2><a href=#window>Window</a></code>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-document-window id=custom-elements-api:concept-document-window-2 href=#concept-document-window>associated
    <code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a> is always created with a new
    <code data-x-lt=customelementregistry id=custom-elements-api:customelementregistry-4><a href=#customelementregistry>CustomElementRegistry</a></code> object.</p>
   <li><p>Return <a data-x-lt=this id=custom-elements-api:this-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-document-window id=custom-elements-api:concept-document-window-3 href=#concept-document-window>associated
   <code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a>'s <a data-x-lt=document-custom-element-registry id=custom-elements-api:document-custom-element-registry-2 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-custom-element-registry data-x-internal=document-custom-element-registry>custom element
   registry</a>.</ol>
  </div>

