</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android unknown"><span>Opera Android</span><span>?</span></span></div></div></div><dd>Returns a promise that will be fulfilled with the <a data-x-lt="custom element" id=custom-elements-api:custom-element-5 href=#custom-element>custom element</a>'s constructor
