  <ol><li><p>If <var>name</var> is not a <a data-x-lt="valid custom element name" id=custom-elements-api:valid-custom-element-name-5 href=#valid-custom-element-name>valid custom element name</a>, then return <a data-x-lt="a promise rejected with" id=custom-elements-api:a-promise-rejected-with href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#a-promise-rejected-with data-x-internal=a-promise-rejected-with>a
   promise rejected with</a> a <a data-x-lt="syntaxerror" id=custom-elements-api:syntaxerror-3 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror data-x-internal=syntaxerror>"<code data-x-lt=syntaxerror>SyntaxError</code>"</a>
   <code data-x-lt=domexception id=custom-elements-api:domexception-11><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=custom-elements-api:this-21 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="custom element definition set" id=custom-elements-api:custom-element-definition-set-6 href=#custom-element-definition-set>custom element definition set</a> <a data-x-lt="list contains" id=custom-elements-api:list-contains-7 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-contain data-x-internal=list-contains>contains</a> an item with <a data-x-lt=concept-custom-element-definition-name id=custom-elements-api:concept-custom-element-definition-name-8 href=#concept-custom-element-definition-name>name</a> <var>name</var>, then return <a data-x-lt="a promise resolved with" id=custom-elements-api:a-promise-resolved-with href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#a-promise-resolved-with data-x-internal=a-promise-resolved-with>a
