   <a data-x-lt="map exists" id=custom-elements-api:map-exists-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists data-x-internal=map-exists>exist</a>, then <a data-x-lt="map set" id=custom-elements-api:map-set-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-set data-x-internal=map-set>set</a>
