><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android unknown"><span>Opera Android</span><span>?</span></span></div></div></div>

  <p>The IDL for the <code data-x-lt=elementinternals id=the-elementinternals-interface:elementinternals-2><a href=#elementinternals>ElementInternals</a></code> interface is as follows, with the various operations and attributes
  defined in the following sections:</p>

