                         optional (<a data-x-lt=file id=the-elementinternals-interface:file-2 href=https://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#dfn-file data-x-internal=file>File</a> or <a data-x-lt=idl-usvstring id=the-elementinternals-interface:idl-usvstring-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-USVString data-x-internal=idl-usvstring>USVString</a> or <a data-x-lt=formdata id=the-elementinternals-interface:formdata-2 href=https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/#formdata data-x-internal=formdata>FormData</a>)? state);

