   <dt><dfn data-noexport="" data-dfn-type=selector data-x=selector-optional id=selector-optional><code>:optional</code></dfn><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:optional title="The :optional CSS pseudo-class represents any <input>, <select>, or <textarea> element that does not have the required attribute set on it.">:optional</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>4+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>5+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>10+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>10+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>10+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios yes"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>5+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android yes"><span>WebView Android</span><span>37+</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>10.1+</span></span></div></div></div><dd>
    <p>The <code data-x-lt=selector-optional id=pseudo-classes:selector-optional><a href=#selector-optional>:optional</a></code> <a data-x-lt=pseudo-class id=pseudo-classes:pseudo-class-25 href=https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors/#pseudo-class data-x-internal=pseudo-class>pseudo-class</a> must match
