    <p>The <code data-x-lt=selector-read-only id=pseudo-classes:selector-read-only><a href=#selector-read-only>:read-only</a></code> <a data-x-lt=pseudo-class id=pseudo-classes:pseudo-class-28 href=https://drafts.csswg.org/selectors/#pseudo-class data-x-internal=pseudo-class>pseudo-class</a> must match
