    <p>A single property with the name <code data-x-lt=md-vcard-uid id=vcard:md-vcard-uid><a href=#md-vcard-uid>uid</a></code> may be present within
    each <a data-x-lt=concept-item id=vcard:concept-item-79 href=#concept-item>item</a> with the type <code data-x-lt=md-vcard id=vcard:md-vcard-50><a href=#md-vcard>http://microformats.org/profile/hcard</a></code>.</p>
   <dt><dfn data-x=md-vcard-url id=md-vcard-url><code>url</code></dfn><dd>
    <p>Gives a <a data-x-lt=url id=vcard:url-4 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url data-x-internal=url>URL</a> relating to the person or organization.</p>

