    URL</a>.</p>

    <p>Any number of properties with the name <code data-x-lt=md-vcard-url id=vcard:md-vcard-url><a href=#md-vcard-url>url</a></code> may be present
    within each <a data-x-lt=concept-item id=vcard:concept-item-80 href=#concept-item>item</a> with the type <code data-x-lt=md-vcard id=vcard:md-vcard-51><a href=#md-vcard>http://microformats.org/profile/hcard</a></code>.</p>
   </dl>

