  <div algorithm="">
  <p>Each <code data-x-lt=window id=the-useractivation-interface:window><a href=#window>Window</a></code> has an <dfn data-x="associated useractivation" id=associated-useractivation>associated <code>UserActivation</code></dfn>, which is a
  <code data-x-lt=useractivation id=the-useractivation-interface:useractivation-2><a href=#useractivation>UserActivation</a></code> object. Upon creation of the <code data-x-lt=window id=the-useractivation-interface:window-2><a href=#window>Window</a></code> object, its
  <a data-x-lt="associated useractivation" id=the-useractivation-interface:associated-useractivation href=#associated-useractivation>associated <code data-x-lt=useractivation>UserActivation</code></a> must be set to a <a data-x-lt=new id=the-useractivation-interface:new href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#new data-x-internal=new>new</a>
  <code data-x-lt=useractivation id=the-useractivation-interface:useractivation-3><a href=#useractivation>UserActivation</a></code> object created in the <code data-x-lt=window id=the-useractivation-interface:window-3><a href=#window>Window</a></code> object's <a data-x-lt=concept-relevant-realm id=the-useractivation-interface:concept-relevant-realm href=#concept-relevant-realm>relevant realm</a>.</p>
  </div>

