  <dl class=domintro><dt><code><var>watcher</var> = new <a id=dom-closewatcher-dev href=#dom-closewatcher>CloseWatcher</a>()</code><dt><code><var>watcher</var> = new <a data-x-lt=dom-closewatcher id=the-closewatcher-interface:dom-closewatcher-2 href=#dom-closewatcher>CloseWatcher</a>({ <a id=dom-closewatcheroptions-signal-dev href=#dom-closewatcheroptions-signal>signal</a> })</code><dd>
    <p>Creates a new <code data-x-lt=closewatcher id=the-closewatcher-interface:closewatcher-2><a href=#closewatcher>CloseWatcher</a></code> instance.</p>

    <p>If the <code data-x-lt=dom-closewatcheroptions-signal id=the-closewatcher-interface:dom-closewatcheroptions-signal><a href=#dom-closewatcheroptions-signal>signal</a></code> option is provided, then
