  <dl class=domintro><dt><code><var>dataTransfer</var> = new <a id=dom-datatransfer-dev href=#dom-datatransfer>DataTransfer</a>()</code><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/DataTransfer/DataTransfer title="The DataTransfer constructor creates a new DataTransfer object instance.">DataTransfer/DataTransfer</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>62+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>14.1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>59+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera unknown"><span>Opera</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>17+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie no"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>No</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios unknown"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android yes"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>8.0+</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>44+</span></span></div></div></div><dd>
