    <p>If <var>element</var>'s <a data-x-lt="opened in popover mode" id=the-popover-attribute:opened-in-popover-mode-6 href=#opened-in-popover-mode>opened in popover mode</a> is "<code>auto</code>"
    or "<code>hint</code>":</p>

    <ol><li><p>If <var>hintPopoverListContainsElement</var> is true, then run <a data-x-lt="hide popover stack until" id=the-popover-attribute:hide-popover-stack-until-4 href=#hide-popover-stack-until>hide popover stack
     until</a> given <var>document</var>, <var>element</var>, <a data-x-lt=attr-popover-hint-state id=the-popover-attribute:attr-popover-hint-state-9 href=#attr-popover-hint-state>Hint</a>, <var>focusPreviousElement</var>, and
