   <li>
    <p>Otherwise:</p>

    <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-popover-attribute:assert-9 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>source</var> is null.</ol>
   <li><p>Let <var>document</var> be <var>newPopoverOrTopLayerElement</var>'s <a data-x-lt="node document" id=the-popover-attribute:node-document-3 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document data-x-internal=node-document>node
   document</a>.<li><p>Let <var>combinedPopovers</var> be <var>document</var>'s <a data-x-lt="showing auto popover list" id=the-popover-attribute:auto-popover-list-8 href=#auto-popover-list>showing auto popover
   list</a> <a data-x-lt="list extend" id=the-popover-attribute:list-extend href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-extend data-x-internal=list-extend>extended</a> with <var>document</var>'s <a data-x-lt="showing hint popover list" id=the-popover-attribute:showing-hint-popover-list-10 href=#showing-hint-popover-list>showing
