     element</a>.<li><p>If <var>targetPopover</var> is not null and <var>targetPopover</var>'s <code data-x-lt=attr-popover id=popover-light-dismiss:attr-popover-2><a href=#attr-popover>popover</a></code> attribute is in the <a data-x-lt=attr-popover-auto-state id=popover-light-dismiss:attr-popover-auto-state-3 href=#attr-popover-auto-state>Auto</a> state or the <a data-x-lt=attr-popover-hint-state id=popover-light-dismiss:attr-popover-hint-state-3 href=#attr-popover-hint-state>Hint</a> state, and <var>targetPopover</var>'s
