  <ol><li>
    <p>Let <var>newCOOPEnforcementResult</var> be a new <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-result id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-result-2 href=#coop-enforcement-result>opener policy enforcement result</a> with</p>

