    <p>If the result of <a data-x-lt=check-browsing-context-group-switch-coop-value id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:check-browsing-context-group-switch-coop-value-4 href=#check-browsing-context-group-switch-coop-value>checking if
