    <ol><li><p>Set <var>newCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-bcg-switch id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-bcg-switch-3 href=#coop-enforcement-bcg-switch>needs a browsing context group switch</a> to
