      <p>If <var>browsingContext</var>'s <a data-x-lt="tlbc group" id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:tlbc-group href=#tlbc-group>group</a>'s <a data-x-lt="browsing context set" id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:browsing-context-set href=#browsing-context-set>browsing
      context set</a>'s <a data-x-lt="list size" id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:list-size href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-size data-x-internal=list-size>size</a> is greater than 1:</p>

      <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=coop-violation-navigation-to id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-violation-navigation-to href=#coop-violation-navigation-to>Queue a violation report for browsing
