       <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-coop id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-coop-3 href=#coop-enforcement-coop>opener
       policy</a>, "<code>enforce</code>", <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s
       <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-url id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-url-3 href=#coop-enforcement-url>url</a>, <var>responseURL</var>,
       <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-origin id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-origin-4 href=#coop-enforcement-origin>origin</a>, <var>responseOrigin</var>, and
       <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-source id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-source-2 href=#coop-enforcement-source>current
       context is navigation source</a>.</ol>
     </ol>
   <li>
    <p>If the result of <a data-x-lt=check-bcg-switch-navigation-report-only id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:check-bcg-switch-navigation-report-only href=#check-bcg-switch-navigation-report-only>checking if
