    <var>isInitialAboutBlank</var>, <var>responseOrigin</var>,
    <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-origin id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-origin-5 href=#coop-enforcement-origin>origin</a>,
    <var>responseCOOP</var>, and <var>currentCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-coop id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-coop-4 href=#coop-enforcement-coop>opener policy</a>, is true:</p>

    <ol><li><p>Set <var>newCOOPEnforcementResult</var>'s <a data-x-lt=coop-enforcement-bcg-switch-report-only id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:coop-enforcement-bcg-switch-report-only-3 href=#coop-enforcement-bcg-switch-report-only>would
     need a browsing context group switch due to report-only</a> to true.<li>
      <p>If <var>browsingContext</var>'s <a data-x-lt="tlbc group" id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:tlbc-group-2 href=#tlbc-group>group</a>'s <a data-x-lt="browsing context set" id=browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy:browsing-context-set-2 href=#browsing-context-set>browsing
