   then return true.<li><p>Let <var>policy</var> be <var>workerGlobalScope</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-workerglobalscope-embedder-policy id=embedder-policy-checks:concept-workerglobalscope-embedder-policy href=#concept-workerglobalscope-embedder-policy>embedder policy</a>.

   <li><p>Let <var>ownerPolicy</var> be <var>owner</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-settings-object-policy-container id=embedder-policy-checks:concept-settings-object-policy-container href=#concept-settings-object-policy-container>policy container</a>'s <a data-x-lt=policy-container-embedder-policy id=embedder-policy-checks:policy-container-embedder-policy-2 href=#policy-container-embedder-policy>embedder policy</a>.

   <li><p>If <var>ownerPolicy</var>'s <a data-x-lt=embedder-policy-report-only-value id=embedder-policy-checks:embedder-policy-report-only-value-2 href=#embedder-policy-report-only-value>report-only
   value</a> is <a data-x-lt="compatible with cross-origin isolation" id=embedder-policy-checks:compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation-4 href=#compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation>compatible with cross-origin isolation</a> and <var>policy</var>'s
