   <a data-x-lt="compatible with cross-origin isolation" id=embedder-policy-checks:compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation-5 href=#compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation>compatible with cross-origin isolation</a> or <var>policy</var>'s <a data-x-lt=embedder-policy-value id=embedder-policy-checks:embedder-policy-value-2-6 href=#embedder-policy-value-2>value</a> is <a data-x-lt="compatible with cross-origin isolation" id=embedder-policy-checks:compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation-6 href=#compatible-with-cross-origin-isolation>compatible with cross-origin
   isolation</a>, then return true.<li><p><a data-x-lt="queue a cross-origin embedder policy inheritance violation" id=embedder-policy-checks:queue-a-cross-origin-embedder-policy-inheritance-violation-4 href=#queue-a-cross-origin-embedder-policy-inheritance-violation>Queue a cross-origin embedder policy inheritance violation</a> with
