  <div algorithm="">
  <h6 id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-)><span class=secno>2026</span> <dfn>CrossOriginGetOwnPropertyHelper</dfn> ( <var>O</var>, <var>P</var> )<a class=self-link href=#crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-)></a></h6>

  <p class=note>If this abstract operation returns undefined and there is no custom behavior, the
  caller needs to throw a <a data-x-lt="securityerror" id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):securityerror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror data-x-internal=securityerror>"<code data-x-lt=securityerror>SecurityError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):domexception><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>. In
  practice this is handled by the caller calling <a data-x-lt=crossoriginpropertyfallback id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):crossoriginpropertyfallback-(-p-) href=#crossoriginpropertyfallback-(-p-)>CrossOriginPropertyFallback</a>.</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>crossOriginKey</var> be a tuple consisting of the <a data-x-lt="current settings object" id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):current-settings-object href=#current-settings-object>current settings
   object</a>, <var>O</var>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant settings object" id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):relevant-settings-object href=#relevant-settings-object>relevant settings object</a>, and <var>P</var>.<li>
    <p>For each <var>e</var> of <a data-x-lt=crossoriginproperties id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):crossoriginproperties-(-o-) href=#crossoriginproperties-(-o-)>CrossOriginProperties</a>(<var>O</var>):</p>

    <ol><li>
      <p>If <a data-x-lt=samevalue id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):samevalue href=https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-samevalue data-x-internal=samevalue>SameValue</a>(<var>e</var>.[[Property]], <var>P</var>) is true:</p>

      <ol><li><p>If the value of the <a data-x-lt=[[crossoriginpropertydescriptormap]] id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):crossoriginpropertydescriptormap href=#crossoriginpropertydescriptormap>[[CrossOriginPropertyDescriptorMap]]</a> internal slot of
