       entry's value.<li><p>Let <var>originalDesc</var> be <a data-x-lt=ordinarygetownproperty id=crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-):ordinarygetownproperty href=https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-ordinarygetownproperty data-x-internal=ordinarygetownproperty>OrdinaryGetOwnProperty</a>(<var>O</var>,
       <var>P</var>).<li><p>Let <var>crossOriginDesc</var> be undefined.<li>
