    <p>Can be set to null.</p>
   <dt><code><var>window</var>.<a id=dom-parent-dev href=#dom-parent>parent</a></code><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/parent title="The Window.parent property is a reference to the parent of the current window or subframe.">Window/parent</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>1.3+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>1+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>3+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>9+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios unknown"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>10.1+</span></span></div></div></div><dd><p>Returns the <code data-x-lt=windowproxy id=navigating-nested-browsing-contexts-in-the-dom:windowproxy-3><a href=#windowproxy>WindowProxy</a></code> for the <a data-x-lt=nav-parent id=navigating-nested-browsing-contexts-in-the-dom:nav-parent href=#nav-parent>parent
   navigable</a>.<dt><code><var>window</var>.<a id=dom-frameelement-dev href=#dom-frameelement>frameElement</a></code><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/frameElement title="The Window.frameElement property returns the element (such as <iframe> or <object>) in which the window is embedded.">Window/frameElement</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>3+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>1+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>12.1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge yes"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>12+</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie yes"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>5.5+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android unknown"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios yes"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>1+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>12.1+</span></span></div></div></div><dd>
