  <p>A <code data-x-lt=location id=the-location-interface:location-28><a href=#location>Location</a></code> object has an associated <dfn data-x=concept-location-empty-domstringlist data-dfn-for=Location data-export="" id=concept-location-empty-domstringlist>empty <code>DOMStringList</code></dfn> which is a
