     <var>history</var>.<li><p>If <var>newURL</var> is failure, then throw a <a data-x-lt="securityerror" id=the-history-interface:securityerror-10 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror data-x-internal=securityerror>"<code data-x-lt=securityerror>SecurityError</code>"</a>
     <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-history-interface:domexception-10><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>If <var>document</var> <a data-x-lt="can have its url rewritten" id=the-history-interface:can-have-its-url-rewritten-3 href=#can-have-its-url-rewritten>cannot have its URL
