  <div algorithm="">
  <p>User agents may limit the number of state objects added to the session history per page. If a
  page hits the <a data-x-lt=implementation-defined id=the-history-interface:implementation-defined href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#implementation-defined data-x-internal=implementation-defined>implementation-defined</a> limit, user agents must remove the entry
  immediately after the first entry for that <code data-x-lt=document id=the-history-interface:document-4><a href=#document>Document</a></code> object in the session history
  after having added the new entry. (Thus the state history acts as a FIFO buffer for eviction, but
  as a LIFO buffer for navigation.)</p>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>A <code data-x-lt=document id=the-history-interface:document-5><a href=#document>Document</a></code> <var>document</var> <dfn data-x="can have its url rewritten" id=can-have-its-url-rewritten>can have its URL rewritten</dfn> to a
  <a data-x-lt=url id=the-history-interface:url href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url data-x-internal=url>URL</a> <var>targetURL</var> if the following algorithm returns true:</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>documentURL</var> be <var>document</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-document-url id="the-history-interface:the-document's-address-2" href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-url data-x-internal="the-document's-address">URL</a>.<li><p>If <var>targetURL</var> and <var>documentURL</var> differ in their <a data-x-lt=concept-url-scheme id=the-history-interface:concept-url-scheme href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme data-x-internal=concept-url-scheme>scheme</a>, <a data-x-lt=concept-url-username id=the-history-interface:concept-url-username href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-username data-x-internal=concept-url-username>username</a>,
   <a data-x-lt=concept-url-password id=the-history-interface:concept-url-password href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-password data-x-internal=concept-url-password>password</a>, <a data-x-lt=concept-url-host id=the-history-interface:concept-url-host href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-host data-x-internal=concept-url-host>host</a>, or <a data-x-lt=concept-url-port id=the-history-interface:concept-url-port href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-port data-x-internal=concept-url-port>port</a>
   components, then return false.<li>
    <p>If <var>targetURL</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-scheme id=the-history-interface:concept-url-scheme-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme data-x-internal=concept-url-scheme>scheme</a> is an
    <a data-x-lt="http(s) scheme" id=the-history-interface:http(s)-scheme href=https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-scheme data-x-internal=http(s)-scheme>HTTP(S) scheme</a>, then return true.</p>

    <p class=note>Differences in <a data-x-lt=concept-url-path id=the-history-interface:concept-url-path href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-path data-x-internal=concept-url-path>path</a>, <a data-x-lt=concept-url-query id=the-history-interface:concept-url-query href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-query data-x-internal=concept-url-query>query</a>, and <a data-x-lt=concept-url-fragment id=the-history-interface:concept-url-fragment href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-fragment data-x-internal=concept-url-fragment>fragment</a> are allowed for <code data-x-lt="http protocol" id=the-history-interface:http-protocol><a href=https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc7230.html#http.uri data-x-internal=http-protocol>http:</a></code> and <code data-x-lt="https protocol" id=the-history-interface:https-protocol><a href=https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc7230.html#https.uri data-x-internal=https-protocol>https:</a></code> URLs.</p>
   <li>
    <p>If <var>targetURL</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-url-scheme id=the-history-interface:concept-url-scheme-3 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme data-x-internal=concept-url-scheme>scheme</a> is "<code>file</code>":</p>

    <ol><li><p>If <var>targetURL</var> and <var>documentURL</var> differ in their <a data-x-lt=concept-url-path id=the-history-interface:concept-url-path-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-path data-x-internal=concept-url-path>path</a> component, then return false.<li><p>Return true.</ol>

    <p class=note>Differences in <a data-x-lt=concept-url-query id=the-history-interface:concept-url-query-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-query data-x-internal=concept-url-query>query</a> and <a data-x-lt=concept-url-fragment id=the-history-interface:concept-url-fragment-2 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-fragment data-x-internal=concept-url-fragment>fragment</a> are allowed for <code>file:</code>
