    <p>If <var>targetURL</var> and <var>documentURL</var> differ in their <a data-x-lt=concept-url-path id=the-history-interface:concept-url-path-3 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-path data-x-internal=concept-url-path>path</a> component or <a data-x-lt=concept-url-query id=the-history-interface:concept-url-query-3 href=https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-query data-x-internal=concept-url-query>query</a> components, then return false.</p>

