  <p>Each <code data-x-lt=navigateevent id=the-navigateevent-interface:navigateevent-8><a href=#navigateevent>NavigateEvent</a></code> has an <dfn data-x=concept-navigateevent-abort-controller id=concept-navigateevent-abort-controller>abort controller</dfn>, an
