  <p>Each <code data-x-lt=navigateevent id=the-navigateevent-interface:navigateevent-9><a href=#navigateevent>NavigateEvent</a></code> has a <dfn data-x=concept-navigateevent-classic-history-api-state id=concept-navigateevent-classic-history-api-state>classic history API state</dfn>, a
