    undefined <a data-x-lt=dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-addhandler id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-addhandler href=#dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-addhandler>addHandler</a>(<a data-x-lt=navigationintercepthandler id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationintercepthandler href=#navigationintercepthandler>NavigationInterceptHandler</a> handler);
  };

  callback <dfn data-dfn-type=callback data-x=navigationprecommithandler id=navigationprecommithandler>NavigationPrecommitHandler</dfn> = <a data-x-lt=idl-promise id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:idl-promise href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-promise data-x-internal=idl-promise>Promise</a>&lt;undefined> (<a data-x-lt=navigationprecommitcontroller id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationprecommitcontroller-2 href=#navigationprecommitcontroller>NavigationPrecommitController</a> controller);</code></pre>

  <dl class=domintro><dt><code><var>precommitController</var>.<a id=dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-redirect-dev href=#dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-redirect>redirect</a>(USVString <var>url</var>, <a data-x-lt=navigationnavigateoptions id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationnavigateoptions-2 href=#navigationnavigateoptions>NavigationNavigateOptions</a> <var>options</var>)</code><dd>
    <p>For "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-push id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-push><a href=#dom-navigationtype-push>push</a></code>" or "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-replace id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-replace><a href=#dom-navigationtype-replace>replace</a></code>" navigations, sets the <code data-x-lt=dom-navigationdestination-url id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationdestination-url><a href=#dom-navigationdestination-url>destination.url</a></code> to <var>url</var>.</p>

    <p>If <var>options</var> is given, also sets the <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-info id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-info><a href=#dom-navigateevent-info>info</a></code> and the resulting
    <code data-x-lt=navigationhistoryentry id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationhistoryentry><a href=#navigationhistoryentry>NavigationHistoryEntry</a></code>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationdestination-state id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationdestination-state href=#concept-navigationdestination-state>state</a> to <var>options</var>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigationoptions-info id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationoptions-info><a href=#dom-navigationoptions-info>info</a></code> and <code data-x-lt=dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state><a href=#dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state>state</a></code>, if they are present. The <code data-x-lt=dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history><a href=#dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history>history</a></code> option can also switch between
    "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-push id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-push-2><a href=#dom-navigationtype-push>push</a></code>" or "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-replace id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-replace-2><a href=#dom-navigationtype-replace>replace</a></code>" navigations types.</p>

    <p>For "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-reload id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-reload><a href=#dom-navigationtype-reload>reload</a></code>" or "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-traverse id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-traverse><a href=#dom-navigationtype-traverse>traverse</a></code>" navigations, an
    <a data-x-lt="invalidstateerror" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:invalidstateerror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror data-x-internal=invalidstateerror>"<code data-x-lt=invalidstateerror>InvalidStateError</code>"</a> will be thrown.</p>

    <p>If the current <code data-x-lt=document id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:document><a href=#document>Document</a></code> <a data-x-lt="can have its url rewritten" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:can-have-its-url-rewritten href=#can-have-its-url-rewritten>cannot have
    its URL rewritten</a> to <var>url</var>, a <a data-x-lt="securityerror" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:securityerror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror data-x-internal=securityerror>"<code data-x-lt=securityerror>SecurityError</code>"</a>
    <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:domexception><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code> will be thrown.</p>
   <dt><code><var>precommitController</var>.<a id=dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-addhandler-dev href=#dom-navigationprecommitcontroller-addhandler>addHandler</a>(<a data-x-lt=navigationintercepthandler id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationintercepthandler-2 href=#navigationintercepthandler>NavigationInterceptHandler</a> <var>handler</var>)</code><dd><p>Adds a <a data-x-lt=navigationintercepthandler id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationintercepthandler-3 href=#navigationintercepthandler>NavigationInterceptHandler</a> callback that would be called once the navigation is committed,
   as if this method was passed to the <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-intercept id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-intercept><a href=#dom-navigateevent-intercept>navigateEvent.intercept()</a></code> method as a <code data-x-lt=dom-navigationinterceptoptions-handler id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationinterceptoptions-handler><a href=#dom-navigationinterceptoptions-handler>handler</a></code>.</dl>

  

  <p>Each <code data-x-lt=navigationprecommitcontroller id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationprecommitcontroller-3><a href=#navigationprecommitcontroller>NavigationPrecommitController</a></code> has a <code data-x-lt=navigateevent id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigateevent><a href=#navigateevent>NavigateEvent</a></code> <dfn data-x=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</dfn>.</p>

