   <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:domexception-2><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>If <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-4 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event-4 href=#concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</a>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-navigationtype id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-navigationtype><a href=#dom-navigateevent-navigationtype>navigationType</a></code> is neither "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-push id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-push-3><a href=#dom-navigationtype-push>push</a></code>" nor "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-replace id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationtype-replace-3><a href=#dom-navigationtype-replace>replace</a></code>", then throw an
   <a data-x-lt="invalidstateerror" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:invalidstateerror-3 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror data-x-internal=invalidstateerror>"<code data-x-lt=invalidstateerror>InvalidStateError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:domexception-3><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>Let <var>document</var> be <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-5 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-relevant-global href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-document-window id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-document-window href=#concept-document-window>associated <code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a>.<li><p>Let <var>destinationURL</var> be the result of <a data-x-lt="parse a url" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:parse-a-url href=#parse-a-url>parsing</a>
   <var>url</var> given <var>document</var>.<li><p>If <var>destinationURL</var> is failure, then throw a
