   rewritten</a> to <var>destinationURL</var>, then throw a
   <a data-x-lt="securityerror" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:securityerror-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror data-x-internal=securityerror>"<code data-x-lt=securityerror>SecurityError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:domexception-5><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>If <var>options</var>["<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history-2><a href=#dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history>history</a></code>"] is "<code data-x-lt=navigationhistorybehavior-push id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationhistorybehavior-push><a href=#navigationhistorybehavior-push>push</a></code>" or "<code data-x-lt=navigationhistorybehavior-replace id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigationhistorybehavior-replace><a href=#navigationhistorybehavior-replace>replace</a></code>", then set <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-6 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event-5 href=#concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</a>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-navigationtype id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-navigationtype-2><a href=#dom-navigateevent-navigationtype>navigationType</a></code> to <var>options</var>["<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history-3><a href=#dom-navigationnavigateoptions-history>history</a></code>"].<li>
    <p>If <var>options</var>["<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state-2><a href=#dom-navigationnavigateoptions-state>state</a></code>"]
