     <var>serializedState</var>.</ol>
   <li><p>Set <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-9 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event-8 href=#concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</a>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-destination id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-destination-2><a href=#dom-navigateevent-destination>destination</a></code>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationdestination-url id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationdestination-url href=#concept-navigationdestination-url>URL</a> to <var>destinationURL</var>.<li><p>If <var>options</var>["<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationoptions-info id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationoptions-info-2><a href=#dom-navigationoptions-info>info</a></code>"] <a data-x-lt="map exists" id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:map-exists-2 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#map-exists data-x-internal=map-exists>exists</a>, then set <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-10 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s  <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event-9 href=#concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</a>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-info id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigateevent-info-2><a href=#dom-navigateevent-info>info</a></code> to <var>options</var>["<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationoptions-info id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:dom-navigationoptions-info-3><a href=#dom-navigationoptions-info>info</a></code>"].</ol>
  </div>

