  method steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:assert-2 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <a data-x-lt=this id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:this-11 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event-10 href=#concept-navigationprecommitcontroller-event>event</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-interception-state id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:concept-navigateevent-interception-state-3 href=#concept-navigateevent-interception-state>interception state</a> is not "<code>none</code>".<li><p><a data-x-lt=navigateevent-perform-shared-checks id=the-navigationprecommitcontroller-interface:navigateevent-perform-shared-checks-2 href=#navigateevent-perform-shared-checks>Perform shared checks</a> given
