   event</a> to <var>event</var>.<li><p>Set <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt="focus changed during ongoing navigation" id=navigate-event-firing:focus-changed-during-ongoing-navigation href=#focus-changed-during-ongoing-navigation>focus changed during ongoing navigation</a> to
