   <var>navigation</var>.<li>
    <p>If <var>dispatchResult</var> is false:</p>

    <ol><li><p>If <var>navigationType</var> is "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-traverse id=navigate-event-firing:dom-navigationtype-traverse-4><a href=#dom-navigationtype-traverse>traverse</a></code>", then <a data-x-lt="consume history-action user activation" id=navigate-event-firing:consume-history-action-user-activation href=#consume-history-action-user-activation>consume history-action user
     activation</a> given <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=navigate-event-firing:concept-relevant-global-6 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a>.<li><p>If <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-abort-controller id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigateevent-abort-controller-3 href=#concept-navigateevent-abort-controller>abort
     controller</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-abortcontroller-signal id=navigate-event-firing:concept-abortcontroller-signal-2 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortcontroller-signal data-x-internal=concept-abortcontroller-signal>signal</a> is not <a data-x-lt=abortsignal-aborted id=navigate-event-firing:abortsignal-aborted href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#abortsignal-aborted data-x-internal=abortsignal-aborted>aborted</a>, then <a data-x-lt="abort the ongoing navigation" id=navigate-event-firing:abort-the-ongoing-navigation href=#abort-the-ongoing-navigation>abort the ongoing navigation</a>
