   <li>
    <p>If <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-interception-state id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigateevent-interception-state href=#concept-navigateevent-interception-state>interception
    state</a> is not "<code>none</code>":</p>

