      <p>Set <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigation-transition id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigation-transition href=#concept-navigation-transition>transition</a>
      to a <a data-x-lt=new id=navigate-event-firing:new-6 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#new data-x-internal=new>new</a> <code data-x-lt=navigationtransition id=navigate-event-firing:navigationtransition><a href=#navigationtransition>NavigationTransition</a></code> created in <var>navigation</var>'s
      <a data-x-lt=concept-relevant-realm id=navigate-event-firing:concept-relevant-realm-9 href=#concept-relevant-realm>relevant realm</a>, with

      <dl class=props><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-navigationtype id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-navigationtype href=#concept-navigationtransition-navigationtype>navigation type</a><dd><var>navigationType</var><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-from id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-from href=#concept-navigationtransition-from>from entry</a><dd><var>fromNHE</var><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-destination id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-destination href=#concept-navigationtransition-destination>destination</a><dd><var>event</var>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-destination id=navigate-event-firing:dom-navigateevent-destination-2><a href=#dom-navigateevent-destination>destination</a></code><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-committed id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-committed href=#concept-navigationtransition-committed>committed promise</a><dd>a new promise created in <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-relevant-realm id=navigate-event-firing:concept-relevant-realm-10 href=#concept-relevant-realm>relevant realm</a><dt><a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-finished id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-finished href=#concept-navigationtransition-finished>finished promise</a><dd>a new promise created in <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-relevant-realm id=navigate-event-firing:concept-relevant-realm-11 href=#concept-relevant-realm>relevant realm</a></dl>
     <li>
      <p><a data-x-lt="mark as handled" id=navigate-event-firing:mark-as-handled href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#mark-a-promise-as-handled data-x-internal=mark-as-handled>Mark as handled</a> <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigation-transition id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigation-transition-2 href=#concept-navigation-transition>transition</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-finished id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-finished-2 href=#concept-navigationtransition-finished>finished promise</a>.</p>

