     <li><p><a data-x-lt="mark as handled" id=navigate-event-firing:mark-as-handled-2 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#mark-a-promise-as-handled data-x-internal=mark-as-handled>Mark as handled</a> <var>navigation</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigation-transition id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigation-transition-3 href=#concept-navigation-transition>transition</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigationtransition-committed id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigationtransition-committed-2 href=#concept-navigationtransition-committed>committed promise</a>.</ol>
   <li><p>If <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-navigation-precommit-handler-list id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigateevent-navigation-precommit-handler-list href=#concept-navigateevent-navigation-precommit-handler-list>navigation precommit handler
   list</a> <a data-x-lt="list is empty" id=navigate-event-firing:list-is-empty-2 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty data-x-internal=list-is-empty>is empty</a> then <a data-x-lt="commit a navigate event" id=navigate-event-firing:commit-a-navigate-event href=#commit-a-navigate-event>commit</a> <var>event</var> given <var>apiMethodTracker</var>.<li>
    <p>Otherwise:</p>

