   object</a>'s <a data-x-lt=window-navigation-api id=navigate-event-firing:window-navigation-api href=#window-navigation-api>navigation API</a>'s <a data-x-lt="ongoing navigate event" id=navigate-event-firing:ongoing-navigate-event-5 href=#ongoing-navigate-event>ongoing <code data-x=event-navigate data-x-lt=event-navigate>navigate</code> event</a>.<li><p>If <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-interception-state id=navigate-event-firing:concept-navigateevent-interception-state-6 href=#concept-navigateevent-interception-state>interception
   state</a> is not "<code>intercepted</code>", then <a data-x-lt=navigateevent-finish id=navigate-event-firing:navigateevent-finish-3 href=#navigateevent-finish>finish</a> <var>event</var> given false.<li><p><a data-x-lt="abort a navigateevent" id=navigate-event-firing:abort-a-navigateevent href=#abort-a-navigateevent>Abort</a> <var>event</var> given
