    <p>If <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-scroll id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-navigateevent-scroll href=#concept-navigateevent-scroll>scroll behavior</a> is
    "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationscrollbehavior-manual id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:dom-navigationscrollbehavior-manual><a href=#dom-navigationscrollbehavior-manual>manual</a></code>", then return.</p>

    <p class=note>If it was left as null, then we treat that as "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationscrollbehavior-after-transition id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:dom-navigationscrollbehavior-after-transition><a href=#dom-navigationscrollbehavior-after-transition>after-transition</a></code>", and continue
    onward.</p>
   <li><p><a data-x-lt="process scroll behavior" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:process-scroll-behavior href=#process-scroll-behavior>Process scroll behavior</a> given <var>event</var>.</p>
  </ol>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>To <dfn data-x="process scroll behavior" id=process-scroll-behavior>process scroll behavior</dfn> given a <code data-x-lt=navigateevent id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:navigateevent-4><a href=#navigateevent>NavigateEvent</a></code> <var>event</var>:</p>

  <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt=assert id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:assert-6 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#assert data-x-internal=assert>Assert</a>: <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-interception-state id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-navigateevent-interception-state-9 href=#concept-navigateevent-interception-state>interception state</a> is "<code>committed</code>".<li><p>Set <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-navigateevent-interception-state id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-navigateevent-interception-state-10 href=#concept-navigateevent-interception-state>interception state</a> to "<code>scrolled</code>".<li><p>If <var>event</var>'s <code data-x-lt=dom-navigateevent-navigationtype id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:dom-navigateevent-navigationtype><a href=#dom-navigateevent-navigationtype>navigationType</a></code> was initialized to "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-traverse id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:dom-navigationtype-traverse><a href=#dom-navigationtype-traverse>traverse</a></code>" or "<code data-x-lt=dom-navigationtype-reload id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:dom-navigationtype-reload><a href=#dom-navigationtype-reload>reload</a></code>", then <a data-x-lt="restore scroll position data" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:restore-scroll-position-data href=#restore-scroll-position-data>restore scroll position data</a>
   given <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-relevant-global-3 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a>'s <a data-x-lt="window navigable" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:window-navigable href=#window-navigable>navigable</a>'s <a data-x-lt=nav-active-history-entry id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:nav-active-history-entry href=#nav-active-history-entry>active session history
   entry</a>.<li>
    <p>Otherwise:</p>

    <ol><li><p>Let <var>document</var> be <var>event</var>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-relevant-global-4 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a>'s
     <a data-x-lt=concept-document-window id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:concept-document-window-2 href=#concept-document-window>associated <code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a>.<li><p>If <var>document</var>'s <a data-x-lt="indicated part" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:the-indicated-part-of-the-document href=#the-indicated-part-of-the-document>indicated part</a> is null, then <a data-x-lt="scroll to the beginning of the document" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:scroll-to-the-beginning-of-the-document href=https://drafts.csswg.org/cssom-view/#scroll-to-the-beginning-of-the-document data-x-internal=scroll-to-the-beginning-of-the-document>scroll to the
     beginning of the document</a> given <var>document</var>. <a href=#refsCSSOMVIEW>[CSSOMVIEW]</a><li><p>Otherwise, <a data-x-lt="scroll to the fragment" id=navigate-event-scroll-focus:scroll-to-the-fragment-identifier href=#scroll-to-the-fragment-identifier>scroll to the fragment</a> given <var>document</var>.</ol>
