     <var>parentNavigableEntries</var> whose <a data-x-lt=she-document-state id=child-navigables:she-document-state-2 href=#she-document-state>document
     state</a> equals <var>parentDocState</var>.<li><p>Set <var>historyEntry</var>'s <a data-x-lt=she-step id=child-navigables:she-step href=#she-step>step</a> to
     <var>targetStepSHE</var>'s <a data-x-lt=she-step id=child-navigables:she-step-2 href=#she-step>step</a>.<li><p>Let <var>nestedHistory</var> be a new <a data-x-lt="nested history" id=child-navigables:nested-history href=#nested-history>nested history</a> whose <a data-x-lt=nested-history-id id=child-navigables:nested-history-id href=#nested-history-id>id</a> is <var>navigable</var>'s <a data-x-lt=nav-id id=child-navigables:nav-id href=#nav-id>id</a>
