  <p>To <dfn data-x="clear the forward session history" id=clear-the-forward-session-history>clear the forward session history</dfn> of a <a data-x-lt="traversable navigable" id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:traversable-navigable href=#traversable-navigable>traversable navigable</a>
