    <p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:list-iterate-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>entryList</var> of
    <var>entryLists</var>:</p>

