      <p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:list-iterate-4 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>entry</var> of <var>entryList</var>:</p>

      <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:list-iterate-5 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>nestedHistory</var> of
       <var>entry</var>'s <a data-x-lt=she-document-state id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:she-document-state-6 href=#she-document-state>document state</a>'s <a data-x-lt=document-state-nested-histories id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:document-state-nested-histories-2 href=#document-state-nested-histories>nested histories</a>, <a data-x-lt="set append" id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:set-append-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#set-append data-x-internal=set-append>append</a> <var>nestedHistory</var>'s <a data-x-lt=nested-history-entries id=low-level-operations-on-session-history:nested-history-entries-3 href=#nested-history-entries>entries list</a> to <var>entryLists</var>.</ol>
