  <div algorithm="">
  <p>To <dfn data-x="getting all navigables that only need history object length/index update" id=getting-all-navigables-that-only-need-history-object-length/index-update>get
  all navigables that only need history object length/index update</dfn> given a <a data-x-lt="traversable navigable" id=updating-the-traversable:traversable-navigable-12 href=#traversable-navigable>traversable
