   <li><p><a data-x-lt="create the navigation timing entry" id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:create-the-navigation-timing-entry-2 href=https://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/#dfn-create-the-navigation-timing-entry data-x-internal=create-the-navigation-timing-entry>Create the navigation timing entry</a> for <var>document</var>, with
   <var>navigationParams</var>'s <a data-x-lt=navigation-params-response id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:navigation-params-response-9 href=#navigation-params-response>response</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-response-timing-info id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:concept-response-timing-info-2 href=https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response-timing-info data-x-internal=concept-response-timing-info>timing info</a>, <var>redirectCount</var>,
   <var>navigationParams</var>'s <a data-x-lt=navigation-params-nav-timing-type id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:navigation-params-nav-timing-type href=#navigation-params-nav-timing-type>navigation timing
   type</a>, and <var>navigationParams</var>'s <a data-x-lt=navigation-params-response id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:navigation-params-response-10 href=#navigation-params-response>response</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-response-service-worker-timing-info id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:concept-response-service-worker-timing-info-2 href=https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#response-service-worker-timing-info data-x-internal=concept-response-service-worker-timing-info>service worker timing info</a>.<li>
    <p>If <var>navigationParams</var>'s <a data-x-lt=navigation-params-response id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:navigation-params-response-11 href=#navigation-params-response>response</a>
