    <ol><li><p>Let <var>value</var> be the <a data-x-lt="isomorphic decode" id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:isomorphic-decode href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#isomorphic-decode data-x-internal=isomorphic-decode>isomorphic decoding</a>
     of the value of the header.<li><p>Run the <a data-x-lt="shared declarative refresh steps" id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:shared-declarative-refresh-steps href=#shared-declarative-refresh-steps>shared declarative refresh steps</a> with <var>document</var> and
     <var>value</var>.</ol>

    <p class=XXX>We do not currently have a spec for how to handle multiple `<code data-x-lt=refresh id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:refresh-2><a href=#refresh>Refresh</a></code>`
