   hints</a> with <var>document</var>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="process link headers" id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:process-link-headers href=#process-link-headers>Process link headers</a> given <var>document</var>,
   <var>navigationParams</var>'s <a data-x-lt=navigation-params-response id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:navigation-params-response-12 href=#navigation-params-response>response</a>, and
