    top-level traversables</a>, so it would be wasteful to fetch these rules otherwise.</p>
   <li><p><a data-x-lt="potentially free deferred fetch quota" id=shared-document-creation-infrastructure:potentially-free-deferred-fetch-quota href=https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#potentially-free-deferred-fetch-quota data-x-internal=potentially-free-deferred-fetch-quota>Potentially free deferred fetch quota</a> for <var>document</var>.<li><p>Return <var>document</var>.</ol>
