    <p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=unloading-documents:list-iterate href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>childNavigable</var> of
    <var>childNavigables</var> <span class=XXX data-x="">in what order?</span>, <a data-x-lt="queue a global task" id=unloading-documents:queue-a-global-task href=#queue-a-global-task>queue a
    global task</a> on the <a data-x-lt="navigation and traversal task source" id=unloading-documents:navigation-and-traversal-task-source href=#navigation-and-traversal-task-source>navigation and traversal task source</a> given
    <var>childNavigable</var>'s <a data-x-lt=nav-window id=unloading-documents:nav-window href=#nav-window>active window</a> to perform the
    following steps:</p>

