     <var>numberUnloaded</var>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="unload a document and its descendants" id=unloading-documents:unload-a-document-and-its-descendants href=#unload-a-document-and-its-descendants>Unload a document and its descendants</a> given <var>childNavigable</var>'s
