     <var>incrementUnloaded</var>.</ol>
   <li><p>Wait until <var>numberUnloaded</var> equals <var>childNavigable</var>'s <a data-x-lt="list size" id=unloading-documents:list-size href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-size data-x-internal=list-size>size</a>.<li>
