   object</a>.<li>
    <p>For each <code data-x-lt=websocket id=unloading-documents:websocket-2><a href=https://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#websocket data-x-internal=websocket-2>WebSocket</a></code> object <var>webSocket</var> whose <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=unloading-documents:concept-relevant-global-8 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global
    object</a> is <var>window</var>, <a data-x-lt="make disappear" id=unloading-documents:make-disappear href=https://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#make-disappear data-x-internal=make-disappear>make disappear</a> <var>webSocket</var>.</p>

    <p>If this affected any <code data-x-lt=websocket id=unloading-documents:websocket-2-2><a href=https://websockets.spec.whatwg.org/#websocket data-x-internal=websocket-2>WebSocket</a></code> objects, then <a data-x-lt="make document unsalvageable" id=unloading-documents:make-document-unsalvageable href=#make-document-unsalvageable>make document
    unsalvageable</a> given <var>document</var> and "<code data-x-lt=blocking-websocket id=unloading-documents:blocking-websocket><a href=#blocking-websocket>websocket</a></code>".</p>
   <li><p>For each <code data-x-lt=webtransport id=unloading-documents:webtransport><a href=https://w3c.github.io/webtransport/#webtransport data-x-internal=webtransport>WebTransport</a></code> object <var>transport</var> whose <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=unloading-documents:concept-relevant-global-9 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global
   object</a> is <var>window</var>, run the <a data-x-lt="context cleanup steps" id=unloading-documents:context-cleanup-steps href=https://w3c.github.io/webtransport/#context-cleanup-steps data-x-internal=context-cleanup-steps>context cleanup steps</a> given
   <var>transport</var>.<li>
    <p>If <var>document</var>'s <i data-x-lt=concept-document-salvageable id=unloading-documents:concept-document-salvageable-7><a href=#concept-document-salvageable>salvageable</a></i>
    state is false:</p>

    <ol><li><p>For each <code data-x-lt=eventsource id=unloading-documents:eventsource><a href=#eventsource>EventSource</a></code> object <var>eventSource</var> whose <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=unloading-documents:concept-relevant-global-10 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant
     global object</a> is equal to <var>window</var>, <a data-x-lt=concept-eventsource-forcibly-close id=unloading-documents:concept-eventsource-forcibly-close href=#concept-eventsource-forcibly-close>forcibly close</a>
