  <p>To <dfn data-x="collect tags from speculative load candidates" id=collect-tags-from-speculative-load-candidates>collect tags from speculative load candidates</dfn> given a <a data-x-lt=list id=speculation-rules-processing-model:list-4 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list data-x-internal=list>list</a> of <a data-x-lt="speculative load candidate" id=speculation-rules-processing-model:speculative-load-candidate-6 href=#speculative-load-candidate>speculative load candidates</a> <var>candidates</var>:</p>

