    <p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=speculation-rules-processing-model:list-iterate-8 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>candidate</var> of
    <var>candidates</var>:</p>

    <ol><li><p><a data-x-lt="list iterate" id=speculation-rules-processing-model:list-iterate-9 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-iterate data-x-internal=list-iterate>For each</a> <var>tag</var> of <var>candidate</var>'s
     <a data-x-lt=sl-candidate-tags id=speculation-rules-processing-model:sl-candidate-tags-3 href=#sl-candidate-tags>tags</a>: <a data-x-lt="set append" id=speculation-rules-processing-model:set-append href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#set-append data-x-internal=set-append>append</a>
