    <p>If <var>moduleRequest</var>.[[Attributes]] has a <a data-x-lt=record id=creating-scripts:record href=https://tc39.es/ecma262/#sec-list-and-record-specification-type data-x-internal=record>Record</a> <var>entry</var> such
