  <a data-x-lt="import map parse result" id=import-map-parse-results:import-map-parse-result-2 href=#import-map-parse-result>import map parse result</a> <var>result</var>:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If <var>result</var>'s <a data-x-lt=impr-error-to-rethrow id=import-map-parse-results:impr-error-to-rethrow-3 href=#impr-error-to-rethrow>error to rethrow</a> is
