    true.</p>

    <p class=note id=note-update-speculation-rules-queue-errors>When updating speculation rules,
    as opposed to registering them for the first time, we ensure that any <code data-x-lt=event-error id=speculation-rules-parse-results:event-error><a href=#event-error>error</a></code> events are queued as tasks, instead of synchronously fired.
