   object</a>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="queue a global task" id=hostenqueuegenericjob:queue-a-global-task href=#queue-a-global-task>Queue a global task</a> on the <a data-x-lt="javascript engine task source" id=hostenqueuegenericjob:javascript-engine-task-source href=#javascript-engine-task-source>JavaScript engine task source</a> given
