    <p>Returns a fragment of HTML or XML that represents the element and its contents.</p>

    <p>In the case of an XML document, throws an <a data-x-lt="invalidstateerror" id=the-outerhtml-property:invalidstateerror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror data-x-internal=invalidstateerror>"<code data-x-lt=invalidstateerror>InvalidStateError</code>"</a>
    <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-outerhtml-property:domexception><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code> if the element cannot be serialized to XML.</p>
   <dt><code><var>element</var>.<a data-x-lt=dom-element-outerhtml id=the-outerhtml-property:dom-element-outerhtml-3 href=#dom-element-outerhtml>outerHTML</a> = <var>value</var></code><dd>
    <p>Replaces the element with nodes parsed from the given string.</p>

    <p>In the case of an XML document, throws a <a data-x-lt="syntaxerror" id=the-outerhtml-property:syntaxerror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#syntaxerror data-x-internal=syntaxerror>"<code data-x-lt=syntaxerror>SyntaxError</code>"</a>
