    <p>Throws a <a data-x-lt="nomodificationallowederror" id=the-outerhtml-property:nomodificationallowederror href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#nomodificationallowederror data-x-internal=nomodificationallowederror>"<code data-x-lt=nomodificationallowederror>NoModificationAllowedError</code>"</a> <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-outerhtml-property:domexception-3><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code> if
    the parent of the element is a <a data-x-lt=document id=the-outerhtml-property:document href=#document><code data-x-lt=document>Document</code></a>.</p>
   </dl>

  <p class=warning>This property's setter performs no sanitization to remove potentially-dangerous
  elements and attributes like <code data-x-lt=script id=the-outerhtml-property:the-script-element><a href=#the-script-element>script</a></code> or <a data-x-lt="event handler content attributes" id=the-outerhtml-property:event-handler-content-attributes href=#event-handler-content-attributes>event handler content
  attributes</a>.</p>

  

  <div algorithm="">
  <p><code data-x-lt=element id=the-outerhtml-property:element><a href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-element data-x-internal=element>Element</a></code>'s <dfn data-dfn-for=Element data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-element-outerhtml id=dom-element-outerhtml><code>outerHTML</code></dfn> getter steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>element</var> be a fictional node whose only child is <a data-x-lt=this id=the-outerhtml-property:this href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>.<li><p>Return the result of running <a data-x-lt="fragment serializing algorithm steps" id=the-outerhtml-property:fragment-serializing-algorithm-steps href=#fragment-serializing-algorithm-steps>fragment serializing algorithm steps</a> with
