   considered unsafe.</dl>

  <p>A <code data-x-lt=sanitizer id=the-sanitizer-interface:sanitizer-2><a href=#sanitizer>Sanitizer</a></code> object has an associated <dfn data-dfn-for=Sanitizer data-x=configuration id=configuration>configuration</dfn>,
  which is a <a data-x-lt=sanitizerconfig id=the-sanitizer-interface:sanitizerconfig-4 href=#sanitizerconfig>SanitizerConfig</a>.</p>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=Sanitizer data-dfn-type=constructor data-x=dom-sanitizer-constructor id=dom-sanitizer-constructor><code>new
  Sanitizer(<var>configuration</var>)</code></dfn> constructor steps are:</p>

  <ol><li>
    <p>If <var>configuration</var> is a <a data-x-lt=sanitizerpresets id=the-sanitizer-interface:sanitizerpresets-2 href=#sanitizerpresets>SanitizerPresets</a> <a data-x-lt=string id=the-sanitizer-interface:string href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string data-x-internal=string>string</a>:</p>

