  <p><code data-x-lt=sanitizerelementnamespace id=sanitizer-configuration:sanitizerelementnamespace-3><a href=#sanitizerelementnamespace>SanitizerElementNamespace</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=sanitizerattributenamespace id=sanitizer-configuration:sanitizerattributenamespace-2><a href=#sanitizerattributenamespace>SanitizerAttributeNamespace</a></code>,
