        <p>If <var>initiating script</var> is not null:</p>

        <ol><li><p>Set <var>fetch options</var> to a <a data-x-lt="script fetch options" id=timers:script-fetch-options href=#script-fetch-options>script fetch options</a> whose <a data-x-lt=concept-script-fetch-options-nonce id=timers:concept-script-fetch-options-nonce href=#concept-script-fetch-options-nonce>cryptographic nonce</a> is <var>initiating
