   <a data-x-lt=this id=custom-handlers:this-3 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant settings object" id=custom-handlers:relevant-settings-object-2 href=#relevant-settings-object>relevant settings object</a>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="in parallel" id=custom-handlers:in-parallel-2 href=#in-parallel>In parallel</a>: unregister the handler described by <var>normalizedScheme</var>
   and <var>normalizedURLString</var>.</ol>
