  <ol><li><p>If <var>parameters</var> is not a JSON Object, return a <a data-x-lt="webdriver error" id=user-agent-automation:webdriver-error href=https://w3c.github.io/webdriver/#dfn-errors data-x-internal=webdriver-error>WebDriver error</a> with
