  <h5 id=pdf-viewing-support><span class=secno>2026</span> PDF viewing support<a class=self-link href=#pdf-viewing-support></a></h5>

  <dl class=domintro><dt><code><var>window</var>.<a data-x-lt=dom-navigator id=pdf-viewing-support:dom-navigator href=#dom-navigator>navigator</a>.<a id=dom-navigator-pdfviewerenabled-dev href=#dom-navigator-pdfviewerenabled>pdfViewerEnabled</a></code><dd><p>Returns true if the user agent supports inline viewing of PDF files when <a data-x-lt=navigate id=pdf-viewing-support:navigate href=#navigate>navigating</a> to them, or false otherwise. In the latter case, PDF files
