  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <code data-x-lt=pluginarray id=pdf-viewing-support:pluginarray-6><a href=#pluginarray>PluginArray</a></code> interface's <dfn data-dfn-for=PluginArray data-dfn-type=method data-x=dom-pluginarray-item id=dom-pluginarray-item><code>item(<var>index</var>)</code></dfn> method steps are:</p>

  <ol><li><p>Let <var>plugins</var> be <a data-x-lt=this id=pdf-viewing-support:this-5 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="relevant global object" id=pdf-viewing-support:concept-relevant-global-3 href=#concept-relevant-global>relevant global object</a>'s
