       <code data-x-lt=domexception id=the-imagebitmap-interface:domexception-10><a href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException data-x-internal=domexception>DOMException</a></code>.<li><p>Set <var>imageBitmap</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data id=the-imagebitmap-interface:concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data-15 href=#concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data>bitmap
       data</a> to <var>image</var>'s image data, <a data-x-lt="cropped to the source rectangle with formatting" id=the-imagebitmap-interface:cropped-to-the-source-rectangle-with-formatting-5 href=#cropped-to-the-source-rectangle-with-formatting>cropped to the source rectangle with
