     <dd>
      <ol><li><p>Set <var>imageBitmap</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data id=the-imagebitmap-interface:concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data-16 href=#concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data>bitmap
       data</a> to a copy of <var>image</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data id=the-imagebitmap-interface:concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data-17 href=#concept-imagebitmap-bitmap-data>bitmap data</a>, <a data-x-lt="cropped to the source rectangle with formatting" id=the-imagebitmap-interface:cropped-to-the-source-rectangle-with-formatting-6 href=#cropped-to-the-source-rectangle-with-formatting>cropped to the source
