   true } ])</code><div class="mdn-anno wrapped before"><button class=mdn-anno-btn onclick=toggleStatus(this)><b class=all-engines-flag title="Support in all current engines.">✔</b><span>MDN</span></button><div class=feature><p><a href=https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/EventSource/EventSource title="The EventSource() constructor returns a newly-created EventSource, which represents a remote resource.">EventSource/EventSource</a><p class=all-engines-text>Support in all current engines.<div class=support><span data-x="" class="firefox yes"><span>Firefox</span><span>6+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari yes"><span>Safari</span><span>5+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome yes"><span>Chrome</span><span>6+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="opera yes"><span>Opera</span><span>11+</span></span><span data-x="" class="edge_blink yes"><span>Edge</span><span>79+</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="edge unknown"><span>Edge (Legacy)</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="ie no"><span>Internet Explorer</span><span>No</span></span><hr><span data-x="" class="firefox_android yes"><span>Firefox Android</span><span>45+</span></span><span data-x="" class="safari_ios yes"><span>Safari iOS</span><span>5+</span></span><span data-x="" class="chrome_android unknown"><span>Chrome Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="webview_android unknown"><span>WebView Android</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="samsunginternet_android unknown"><span>Samsung Internet</span><span>?</span></span><span data-x="" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>12+</span></span></div></div></div><dd>
