   otherwise let it be null.<li><p>Let <var>options</var> be «[ "<code data-x-lt=dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer id=message-ports:dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer-2><a href=#dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer>transfer</a></code>" → <var>transfer</var>
   ]».<li><p>Run the <a data-x-lt="message port post message steps" id=message-ports:message-port-post-message-steps-2 href=#message-port-post-message-steps>message port post message steps</a> providing <a data-x-lt=this id=message-ports:this-4 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>,
