  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=MessagePort data-dfn-type=method data-x=dom-messageport-start id=dom-messageport-start><code>start()</code></dfn>
  method steps are to enable <a data-x-lt=this id=message-ports:this-5 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="port message queue" id=message-ports:port-message-queue-14 href=#port-message-queue>port message queue</a>, if it is not
