  <p>The following are the <a data-x-lt="event handlers" id=message-ports:event-handlers href=#event-handlers>event handlers</a> (and their corresponding <a data-x-lt="event handler event type" id=message-ports:event-handler-event-type href=#event-handler-event-type>event handler event types</a>) that must be supported,
