   <tbody><tr><td><dfn data-dfn-for=MessagePort data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=handler-messageport-onclose id=handler-messageport-onclose><code>onclose</code></dfn> <td> <code data-x-lt=event-close id=message-ports:event-close-3><a href=#event-close>close</a></code>
