  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The first time a <code data-x-lt=messageport id=message-ports:messageport-18><a href=#messageport>MessagePort</a></code> object's <code data-x-lt=handler-messageeventtarget-onmessage id=message-ports:handler-messageeventtarget-onmessage><a href=#handler-messageeventtarget-onmessage>onmessage</a></code> IDL attribute is set, the port's
  <a data-x-lt="port message queue" id=message-ports:port-message-queue-15 href=#port-message-queue>port message queue</a> must be enabled, as if the <code data-x-lt=dom-messageport-start id=message-ports:dom-messageport-start-2><a href=#dom-messageport-start>start()</a></code> method had been called.</p>
