" class="opera_android yes"><span>Opera Android</span><span>11+</span></span></div></div></div><dt><code><var>dedicatedWorkerGlobal</var>.<a id=dom-dedicatedworkerglobalscope-postmessage-options-dev href=#dom-dedicatedworkerglobalscope-postmessage-options>postMessage</a>(<var>message</var> [, { <a data-x-lt=dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer id=dedicated-workers-and-the-dedicatedworkerglobalscope-interface:dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer href=#dom-structuredserializeoptions-transfer>transfer</a> } ])</code><dd><p>Clones <var>message</var> and transmits it to the <code data-x-lt=worker id=dedicated-workers-and-the-dedicatedworkerglobalscope-interface:worker-2><a href=#worker>Worker</a></code> object associated
