rns <var>sharedWorkerGlobal</var>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-workerglobalscope-name id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:concept-workerglobalscope-name href=#concept-workerglobalscope-name>name</a>, i.e. the value given to the
   <code data-x-lt=sharedworker id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:sharedworker><a href=#sharedworker>SharedWorker</a></code> constructor. Multiple <code data-x-lt=sharedworker id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:sharedworker-2><a href=#sharedworker>SharedWorker</a></code> objects can correspond
