  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <dfn data-dfn-for=SharedWorkerGlobalScope data-dfn-type=attribute data-x=dom-sharedworkerglobalscope-name id=dom-sharedworkerglobalscope-name><code>name</code></dfn> getter steps are to return
  <a data-x-lt=this id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:this href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt=concept-workerglobalscope-name id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:concept-workerglobalscope-name-2 href=#concept-workerglobalscope-name>name</a>. Its value
  represents the name that can be used to obtain a reference to the worker using the
  <code data-x-lt=sharedworker id=shared-workers-and-the-sharedworkerglobalscope-interface:sharedworker-3><a href=#sharedworker>SharedWorker</a></code> constructor.</p>
  </div>

