   settings</var>'s <a data-x-lt="top-level origin" id=script-settings-for-workers:concept-environment-top-level-origin-2 href=#concept-environment-top-level-origin>top-level origin</a>.<li>
    <p>Otherwise, set <var>settings object</var>'s <a data-x-lt="top-level origin" id=script-settings-for-workers:concept-environment-top-level-origin-3 href=#concept-environment-top-level-origin>top-level origin</a> to an
