  </div>

  

  <pre><code class=idl data-x-lt="[exposed=worker] interface workernavigator {}; workernavigator includes navigatorid; workernavigator includes navigatorlanguage; workernavigator includes navigatoronline; workernavigator includes navigatorconcurrenthardware;">[Exposed=Worker]
