interface <dfn data-noexport="" data-dfn-type=interface data-x=fakeworkletglobalscope id=fakeworkletglobalscope>FakeWorkletGlobalScope</dfn> : <a data-x-lt=workletglobalscope id=worklets-examples:workletglobalscope href=#workletglobalscope>WorkletGlobalScope</a> {
