  <p>Each <code data-x-lt=fakeworkletglobalscope id=worklets-examples:fakeworkletglobalscope-4><a href=#fakeworkletglobalscope>FakeWorkletGlobalScope</a></code> has a <dfn data-x="registered class constructors map" id=registered-class-constructors-map>registered class constructors map</dfn>,
