  steps are to set <a data-x-lt=this id=worklets-examples:this-3 href=https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this data-x-internal=this>this</a>'s <a data-x-lt="registered class constructors map" id=worklets-examples:registered-class-constructors-map href=#registered-class-constructors-map>registered class constructors
  map</a>[<var>type</var>] to <var>classConstructor</var>.</p>
