   <code data-x-lt=document id=worklets-creation-termination:document><a href=#document>Document</a></code> whose <a data-x-lt=concept-document-worklet-global-scopes id=worklets-creation-termination:concept-document-worklet-global-scopes-3 href=#concept-document-worklet-global-scopes>worklet global
