  <p>A <code data-x-lt=colgroup id=optional-tags:the-colgroup-element-4><a href=#the-colgroup-element>colgroup</a></code> element's <a data-x-lt=syntax-end-tag id=optional-tags:syntax-end-tag-13 href=#syntax-end-tag>end tag</a> may be omitted
  if the <code data-x-lt=colgroup id=optional-tags:the-colgroup-element-5><a href=#the-colgroup-element>colgroup</a></code> element is not immediately followed by <a data-x-lt="ascii whitespace" id=optional-tags:space-characters-3 href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace data-x-internal=space-characters>ASCII whitespace</a>
  or a <a data-x-lt=syntax-comments id=optional-tags:syntax-comments-6 href=#syntax-comments>comment</a>.</p>

  
  <p>A <code data-x-lt=caption id=optional-tags:the-caption-element><a href=#the-caption-element>caption</a></code> element's <a data-x-lt=syntax-end-tag id=optional-tags:syntax-end-tag-14 href=#syntax-end-tag>end tag</a> may be omitted if
