  <p>A <code data-x-lt=thead id=optional-tags:the-thead-element><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code> element's <a data-x-lt=syntax-end-tag id=optional-tags:syntax-end-tag-15 href=#syntax-end-tag>end tag</a> may be omitted if
