  <p>A <code data-x-lt=tbody id=optional-tags:the-tbody-element-5><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code> element's <a data-x-lt=syntax-end-tag id=optional-tags:syntax-end-tag-17 href=#syntax-end-tag>end tag</a> may be omitted if
  the <code data-x-lt=tbody id=optional-tags:the-tbody-element-6><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code> element is immediately followed by a <code data-x-lt=tbody id=optional-tags:the-tbody-element-7><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code> or
