  <p>A <code data-x-lt=tr id=optional-tags:the-tr-element-2><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code> element's <a data-x-lt=syntax-end-tag id=optional-tags:syntax-end-tag-19 href=#syntax-end-tag>end tag</a> may be omitted if the
