    <p>In any case, switch the <a data-x-lt="insertion mode" id=the-initial-insertion-mode:insertion-mode-3 href=#insertion-mode>insertion mode</a> to "<a data-x-lt="insertion mode: before html" id=the-initial-insertion-mode:the-before-html-insertion-mode-2 href=#the-before-html-insertion-mode>before html</a>", then reprocess the token.</p>
