    <a data-x-lt="parse error" id=parsing-main-incolgroup:parse-errors-4 href=#parse-errors>parse error</a>; ignore the token.</p> 

    <p>Otherwise, pop the <a data-x-lt="current node" id=parsing-main-incolgroup:current-node-5 href=#current-node>current node</a> from the <a data-x-lt="stack of open elements" id=parsing-main-incolgroup:stack-of-open-elements-3 href=#stack-of-open-elements>stack of open
    elements</a>.</p>

    <p>Switch the <a data-x-lt="insertion mode" id=parsing-main-incolgroup:insertion-mode-6 href=#insertion-mode>insertion mode</a> to "<a data-x-lt="insertion mode: in table" id=parsing-main-incolgroup:parsing-main-intable-2 href=#parsing-main-intable>in
