    <p><a data-x-lt="insert an html element" id=parsing-main-intbody:insert-an-html-element href=#insert-an-html-element>Insert an HTML element</a> for the token, then switch the <a data-x-lt="insertion mode" id=parsing-main-intbody:insertion-mode-2 href=#insertion-mode>insertion
    mode</a> to "<a data-x-lt="insertion mode: in row" id=parsing-main-intbody:parsing-main-intr href=#parsing-main-intr>in row</a>".</p>
