    <p><a data-x-lt="clear the stack back to a table body context" id=parsing-main-intbody:clear-the-stack-back-to-a-table-body-context-2 href=#clear-the-stack-back-to-a-table-body-context>Clear the stack back to a table body context</a>. (See below.)</p>

