    row</a>".</p>
    

    <p>Reprocess the current token.</p>
   <dt>An end tag whose tag name is one of: "tbody", "tfoot",
   "thead"<dd>
    <p>If the <a data-x-lt="stack of open elements" id=parsing-main-intbody:stack-of-open-elements href=#stack-of-open-elements>stack of open elements</a> does not <a data-x-lt="has an element in table scope" id=parsing-main-intbody:has-an-element-in-table-scope href=#has-an-element-in-table-scope>have an element in table scope</a> that is an <a data-x-lt="html elements" id=parsing-main-intbody:html-elements href=#html-elements>HTML
