     <a data-x-lt="insertion mode" id=parsing-main-intbody:insertion-mode-4 href=#insertion-mode>insertion mode</a> to "<a data-x-lt="insertion mode: in table" id=parsing-main-intbody:parsing-main-intable href=#parsing-main-intable>in table</a>".</ol>
   <dt>A start tag whose tag name is one of: "caption", "col",
