    <p>If the <a data-x-lt="stack of open elements" id=parsing-main-intbody:stack-of-open-elements-3 href=#stack-of-open-elements>stack of open elements</a> does not <a data-x-lt="has an element in table scope" id=parsing-main-intbody:has-an-element-in-table-scope-2 href=#has-an-element-in-table-scope>have a <code data-x-lt=tbody>tbody</code>, <code data-x-lt=thead>thead</code>, or <code data-x-lt=tfoot>tfoot</code> element in table
    scope</a>, this is a <a data-x-lt="parse error" id=parsing-main-intbody:parse-errors-3 href=#parse-errors>parse error</a>; ignore the token.</p>

