  <h6 id=parsing-main-intr><span class=secno>2026</span> The "<dfn>in row</dfn>" insertion mode<a class=self-link href=#parsing-main-intr></a></h6>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>When the user agent is to apply the rules for the "<a data-x-lt="insertion mode: in row" id=parsing-main-intr:parsing-main-intr href=#parsing-main-intr>in
