  <p>Once the user agent <dfn data-x="stop parsing" id=stop-parsing>stops parsing</dfn> the document, the user agent
  must run the following steps:</p>

  <ol><li><p>If the <a data-x-lt="active speculative html parser" id=the-end:active-speculative-html-parser href=#active-speculative-html-parser>active speculative HTML parser</a> is not null, then <a data-x-lt="stop the speculative html parser" id=the-end:stop-the-speculative-html-parser href=#stop-the-speculative-html-parser>stop the
   speculative HTML parser</a> and return.<li><p>Set the <a data-x-lt="insertion point" id=the-end:insertion-point href=#insertion-point>insertion point</a> to undefined.<li><p><a data-x-lt="update the current document readiness" id=the-end:update-the-current-document-readiness href=#update-the-current-document-readiness>Update the current document readiness</a> to "<code>interactive</code>".<li><p>Pop <em>all</em> the nodes off the <a data-x-lt="stack of open elements" id=the-end:stack-of-open-elements href=#stack-of-open-elements>stack of open elements</a>.<li><p>While the <a data-x-lt="list of scripts that will execute when the document has finished parsing" id=the-end:list-of-scripts-that-will-execute-when-the-document-has-finished-parsing href=#list-of-scripts-that-will-execute-when-the-document-has-finished-parsing>list of scripts that will execute when the document has finished
