     false.<li><p>Set the <code data-x-lt=document id=the-end:document-23><a href=#document>Document</a></code>'s <a data-x-lt="page showing" id=the-end:page-showing-2 href=#page-showing>page showing</a> to true.<li><p><a data-x-lt="fire a page transition event" id=the-end:fire-a-page-transition-event href=#fire-a-page-transition-event>Fire a page transition event</a> named <code data-x-lt=event-pageshow id=the-end:event-pageshow><a href=#event-pageshow>pageshow</a></code> at <var>window</var> with false.<li><p><a data-x-lt="completely finish loading" id=the-end:completely-finish-loading href=#completely-finish-loading>Completely finish loading</a> the <code data-x-lt=document id=the-end:document-24><a href=#document>Document</a></code>.<li><p><a data-x-lt="queue the navigation timing entry" id=the-end:queue-the-navigation-timing-entry href=https://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/#dfn-queue-the-navigation-timing-entry data-x-internal=queue-the-navigation-timing-entry>Queue the navigation timing entry</a> for the <code data-x-lt=document id=the-end:document-25><a href=#document>Document</a></code>.</ol>
