  <p>The <code data-x-lt=thead id=tables-2:the-thead-element-2><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tbody id=tables-2:the-tbody-element-2><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tfoot id=tables-2:the-tfoot-element-2><a href=#the-tfoot-element>tfoot</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tr id=tables-2:the-tr-element-3><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code>,
  <code data-x-lt=td id=tables-2:the-td-element-5><a href=#the-td-element>td</a></code>, and <code data-x-lt=th id=tables-2:the-th-element-5><a href=#the-th-element>th</a></code> elements, when they have an <code>align</code>
  attribute whose value is an <a data-x-lt="ascii case-insensitive" id=tables-2:ascii-case-insensitive href=https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-case-insensitive data-x-internal=ascii-case-insensitive>ASCII case-insensitive</a> match for either the string "<code>center</code>" or the string "<code>middle</code>", are <a data-x-lt=expected id=tables-2:expected-7 href=#expected>expected</a>
  to center text within themselves, as if they had their <a data-x-lt="'text-align'" id="tables-2:'text-align'" href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css-text/#text-align-property data-x-internal="'text-align'">'text-align'</a> property set to
  'center' in a <a data-x-lt="presentational hints" id=tables-2:presentational-hints-2 href=#presentational-hints>presentational hint</a>, and to <a data-x-lt="align descendants" id=tables-2:align-descendants href=#align-descendants>align
  descendants</a> to the center.</p>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <code data-x-lt=thead id=tables-2:the-thead-element-3><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tbody id=tables-2:the-tbody-element-3><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tfoot id=tables-2:the-tfoot-element-3><a href=#the-tfoot-element>tfoot</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tr id=tables-2:the-tr-element-4><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code>,
