  <div algorithm="">
  <p>The <code data-x-lt=thead id=tables-2:the-thead-element-5><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tbody id=tables-2:the-tbody-element-5><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tfoot id=tables-2:the-tfoot-element-5><a href=#the-tfoot-element>tfoot</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tr id=tables-2:the-tr-element-6><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code>,
