  <div algorithm="">
  <p>When a <code data-x-lt=table id=tables-2:the-table-element-8><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=thead id=tables-2:the-thead-element-6><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tbody id=tables-2:the-tbody-element-6><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tfoot id=tables-2:the-tfoot-element-6><a href=#the-tfoot-element>tfoot</a></code>,
  <code data-x-lt=tr id=tables-2:the-tr-element-7><a href=#the-tr-element>tr</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=td id=tables-2:the-td-element-9><a href=#the-td-element>td</a></code>, or <code data-x-lt=th id=tables-2:the-th-element-10><a href=#the-th-element>th</a></code> element has a <code data-x-lt=attr-background id=tables-2:attr-background><a href=#attr-background>background</a></code> attribute set to a non-empty value, the new value is
  <a data-x-lt=expected id=tables-2:expected-12 href=#expected>expected</a> to be <a data-x-lt="encoding-parsing-and-serializing a url" id=tables-2:encoding-parsing-and-serializing-a-url href=#encoding-parsing-and-serializing-a-url>encoding-parsed-and-serialized</a> relative to the element's <a data-x-lt="node document" id=tables-2:node-document href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document data-x-internal=node-document>node document</a>,
