  attribute as a <a data-x-lt="presentational hints" id=tables-2:presentational-hints-6 href=#presentational-hints>presentational hint</a> setting the
  element's <a data-x-lt="'background-image'" id="tables-2:'background-image'" href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds/#propdef-background-image data-x-internal="'background-image'">'background-image'</a> property to the return value.</p>
  </div>

  <div algorithm="">
  <p>When a <code data-x-lt=table id=tables-2:the-table-element-9><a href=#the-table-element>table</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=thead id=tables-2:the-thead-element-7><a href=#the-thead-element>thead</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tbody id=tables-2:the-tbody-element-7><a href=#the-tbody-element>tbody</a></code>, <code data-x-lt=tfoot id=tables-2:the-tfoot-element-7><a href=#the-tfoot-element>tfoot</a></code>,
