  <div algorithm="">
  <p>In <a data-x-lt="quirks mode" id=tables-2:quirks-mode-2 href=https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-quirks data-x-internal=quirks-mode>quirks mode</a>, a <code data-x-lt=td id=tables-2:the-td-element-11><a href=#the-td-element>td</a></code> element or a <code data-x-lt=th id=tables-2:the-th-element-12><a href=#the-th-element>th</a></code> element that has a
