  <div algorithm="">
  <p>An <code data-x-lt=input id=the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:the-input-element-3><a href=#the-input-element>input</a></code> element whose <code data-x-lt=attr-input-type id=the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:attr-input-type-2><a href=#attr-input-type>type</a></code> attribute is in
  the <a data-x-lt=attr-input-type-radio id="the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:radio-button-state-(type=radio)" href="#radio-button-state-(type=radio)">Radio Button</a> state is a <a data-x-lt="non-devolvable widget" id=the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:non-devolvable-widget-2 href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#non-devolvable data-x-internal=non-devolvable-widget>non-devolvable
  widget</a> <a data-x-lt=expected id=the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:expected-2 href=#expected>expected</a> to render as an <a data-x-lt="'inline-block'" id="the-input-element-as-a-checkbox-and-radio-button-widgets:'inline-block'-2" href=https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/#value-def-inline-block data-x-internal="'inline-block'">'inline-block'</a> box containing a
