  <h3 id=requirements-for-implementations><span class=secno>2026</span> Requirements for implementations<a class=self-link href=#requirements-for-implementations></a></h3>

  <h4 id=the-marquee-element><span class=secno>2026</span> The <dfn data-dfn-type=element data-x=marquee><code>marquee</code></dfn> element<a class=self-link href=#the-marquee-element></a></h4>

  <p>The <code data-x-lt=marquee id=the-marquee-element:the-marquee-element><a href=#the-marquee-element>marquee</a></code> element is a presentational element that animates content. CSS
  transitions and animations are a more appropriate mechanism. <a href=#refsCSSANIMATIONS>[CSSANIMATIONS]</a> <a href=#refsCSSTRANSITIONS>[CSSTRANSITIONS]</a></p>

  <p>The <code data-x-lt=marquee id=the-marquee-element:the-marquee-element-2><a href=#the-marquee-element>marquee</a></code> element must implement the <code data-x-lt=htmlmarqueeelement id=the-marquee-element:htmlmarqueeelement><a href=#htmlmarqueeelement>HTMLMarqueeElement</a></code>
  interface.</p>

