  <pre><code class=idl data-x-lt="partial interface htmlmetaelement { [cereactions, reflect] attribute domstring scheme; };">partial interface <a id=HTMLMetaElement-partial data-x-lt=htmlmetaelement href=#htmlmetaelement>HTMLMetaElement</a> {
